var e=[{word:`guitar`,translation:`n. 吉他`,phonetic:`ɡɪ'tɑr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Before singing, he noodled at his guitar.`,cn:`唱歌之前他先弹了几下吉他。`},{en:`He strummed his guitar when he talked to me.`,cn:`他和我说话时把吉他拨弄响了。`}]},{word:`sing`,translation:`v. 唱；唱歌`,phonetic:`sɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She can sing beautifully.`,cn:`她唱歌很好听。`},{en:`Most children enjoy singing.`,cn:`大多数孩子都喜欢唱歌。`},{en:`We had a great time singing some of the old songs .`,cn:`我们唱了一些老歌，非常开心。`},{en:`I’ve never been able to sing in tune (= sing the correct notes ) .`,cn:`我唱歌总是跑调。`},{en:`She patiently sang the baby to sleep .`,cn:`她耐心地唱歌哄宝宝入睡。`}]},{word:`swim`,translation:`v. 游泳`,phonetic:`swɪm`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Let’s go swimming this afternoon.`,cn:`今天下午我们游泳去吧。`},{en:`kids learning to swim the backstroke`,cn:`学习仰泳的孩子们`},{en:`She was the first woman to swim the Channel.`,cn:`她是第一个游过英吉利海峡的女性。`}]},{word:`dance`,translation:`v. 跳舞`,phonetic:`dæns`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Come on, let’s dance.`,cn:`来吧，我们跳舞吧。`}]},{word:`draw`,translation:`v. 画`,phonetic:`drɔ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Katie had drawn a cottage with a little stream running next to it.`,cn:`凯蒂画了一间小茅舍，旁边流淌着一条小溪。`},{en:`She asked the little girl to draw a picture of the man she’d spoken to.`,cn:`她让小女孩把刚才和她说话的那个男人画出来。`},{en:`Keith was drawing a complicated-looking graph.`,cn:`基思在画一张看上去很复杂的图表。`},{en:`I’ve never been able to draw very well.`,cn:`我从来就画不好图画。`}]},{word:`chess`,translation:`n. 国际象棋`,phonetic:`tʃɛs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They meet fairly often to play chess .`,cn:`他们经常在一起下国际象棋。`}]},{word:`play  chess`,translation:`下国际象棋`,phonetic:`ple tʃɛs`,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`speak`,translation:`v. 说；说话`,phonetic:`spik`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I was so shocked I couldn’t speak.`,cn:`我震惊得说不出话来。`},{en:`He spoke very softly (= quietly ) .`,cn:`他说话声音非常轻柔。`}]},{word:`speak  English`,translation:`说英语`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`join`,translation:`v. 参加；加入`,phonetic:`dʒɔɪn`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`When did you join the Labour Party?`,cn:`你何时加入工党的？`},{en:`I decided to join the army.`,cn:`我决定去参军。`},{en:`You can enjoy a sport without joining a club or belonging to a team.`,cn:`不加盟俱乐部或球队也可以享受体育运动的乐趣。`}]},{word:`club`,translation:`n. 俱乐部；社团`,phonetic:`klʌb`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Manchester United Football Club`,cn:`曼联（队）足球俱乐部`}]},{word:`be good at…`,translation:`擅长于……`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`tell`,translation:`v. 讲述；告诉`,phonetic:`tel`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I’ll tell you all about it when I get back.`,cn:`我回来再告诉你这一切。`},{en:`Sheppard was telling the truth .`,cn:`谢泼德说的是实话。`}]},{word:`story`,translation:`n. 故事；小说`,phonetic:`stɔrɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a book of short stories`,cn:`短篇小说集`},{en:`We cuddled together over a bedtime story .`,cn:`我们依偎在一起看睡前故事。`},{en:`The film was based on a true story .`,cn:`这部影片是根据真实故事改编的。`},{en:`Don’t be frightened – it’s only a story (= it is imaginary ) .`,cn:`别害怕，这只是一个故事。`}]},{word:`write`,translation:`v. 写作，写字`,phonetic:`raɪt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I wrote her several letters , but she didn’t reply.`,cn:`我给她写了几封信，可是她没有回复。`}]},{word:`show`,translation:`n. 演出;表演; v. 向某人出示`,phonetic:`ʃo`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`I enjoyed the show immensely.`,cn:`我非常喜欢这场演出。`},{en:`The show starts at 7:30 pm.`,cn:`演出晚上7点30分开始。`},{en:`They’ve come to town to see a Broadway show.`,cn:`他们到城里来看一场百老汇演出。`},{en:`Perry was the star of the show .`,cn:`佩里是这台演出的明星。`},{en:`The man grinned, showing bad teeth.`,cn:`那男人咧着嘴笑，露出一口坏牙。`}]},{word:`or`,translation:`conj. 或者`,phonetic:`ɔr`,partOfSpeech:`conj`,examples:[{en:`Shall we go out to the cinema or stay at home?`,cn:`我们是出去看电影还是待在家里？`},{en:`You can have ham, cheese, or tuna.`,cn:`你可以选择火腿、干酪或者金枪鱼。`},{en:`She wasn’t involved in drugs or anything like that.`,cn:`她没有涉毒之类的行为。`},{en:`Grapes are usually either green or red.`,cn:`葡萄一般要么是绿色，要么是红色。`},{en:`He’s going to do it whether we like it or not.`,cn:`不管我们喜欢与否，他都会去做这件事。`},{en:`You must do the job yourself or else employ someone else to do it.`,cn:`你必须自己做这件事，或者就雇别人去做。`}]},{word:`talk`,translation:`v. 说话；谈话; n. 交谈`,phonetic:`tɔk`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`I could hear Sarah and Andy talking in the next room.`,cn:`我听到萨拉和安迪在隔壁讲话。`},{en:`Sue and Bob still aren’t talking (= are refusing to talk to each other ) .`,cn:`休和鲍勃仍然互不理睬。`},{en:`After a long talk , we decided on divorce.`,cn:`经过一次长谈后，我们决定离婚。`}]},{word:`talk to …`,translation:`跟……说`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`kungfu`,translation:`n. （中国）功夫`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`See,I can even knock down walls with my kungfu.`,cn:`看见没，我用我的功夫把墙都撞倒了`},{en:`What are you doing here?I am practicing kungfu.`,cn:`你在这儿干什么呢？ 我在练习功夫。`},{en:`Whether it be in melodramas, comedies or kungfu movies, the popularity of women lead roles was unprecedented.`,cn:`无论是在剧情片、喜剧片还是功夫片中，女影星主演的角色都前所未有地受欢迎。`}]},{word:`drum`,translation:`n. 鼓`,phonetic:`drʌm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a big bass drum`,cn:`一面低音大鼓`},{en:`1,000 people marched, beating drums and carrying flags.`,cn:`1,000人打着鼓扛着旗游行。`},{en:`Jones played the drums in an all-girl band.`,cn:`琼斯在一个女子乐队里打鼓。`}]},{word:`play the drums`,translation:`敲鼓`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Can you play the drums?`,cn:`你会打鼓吗？`},{en:`You may have always had a desire to play the piano, learn the flute, or even play the drums. Why not learn now when you have the time and freedom to really put your heart into it?`,cn:`你可能一直想学钢琴，学笛子，或是学打鼓，现在你有闲有空，为什么不认认真真去学呢？`}]},{word:`piano`,translation:`n. 钢琴`,phonetic:`pɪ'æno`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Jean accompanied her on the piano .`,cn:`琼为她钢琴伴奏。`}]},{word:`play the piano`,translation:`弹钢琴`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`We learned to play the piano by playing and drive a car by driving.`,cn:`我们以弹来学习弹钢琴，以驾驶来学习驾驶汽车。`},{en:`Organizers of "Britain's Most Talented Pet" say they have found a dog that can mow the lawn and play the piano, the Daily Telegraph reported.`,cn:`据英国《每日电讯报》近日报道，"英国最有才华宠物"节目的组织者说，他们发现了一只既会除草又会弹钢琴的宠物狗。`},{en:`So, despite not really knowing how to play the piano and not knowing how to read or write music, Cicoria got himself a piano and promptly began to play everything he heard in his head.`,cn:`于是，尽管实际上不知道该如何弹钢琴，也不知道如何读写乐谱，西科里拉还是给自己买了一台钢琴，并且立即开始弹奏脑子里听到的一切。`}]},{word:`violin`,translation:`n. 小提琴`,phonetic:`,vaɪə'lɪn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She rippled a lively rhythm on the violin.`,cn:`她在小提琴上奏出明快的节奏。`},{en:`The music of the violin blended sweetly with her voice.`,cn:`小提琴的乐曲和她的嗓音很和谐。`},{en:`He keyed up all the strings of his violin before his performance.`,cn:`他在表演前将小提琴所有的弦都调好了。`}]},{word:`play the violin`,translation:`拉小提琴`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Her friend Julie liked to play the violin.`,cn:`她的朋友朱丽喜欢拉小提琴。`}]},{word:`also`,translation:`adv. 而且；也`,phonetic:`'ɔlso`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Information is also available on women’s health care.`,cn:`还可以获得有关女性保健方面的资料。`},{en:`She sings beautifully and also plays the flute and piano.`,cn:`她歌唱得好，而且还会吹长笛和弹钢琴。`},{en:`The system was not only complicated but also ineffective.`,cn:`这套系统不仅复杂而且效率低。`}]},{word:`people`,translation:`n. 人； 人们`,phonetic:`'pipl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`How many people were at the meeting?`,cn:`有多少人到会？`},{en:`At least 40 people were killed.`,cn:`至少有40人遇害。`},{en:`the people who live next door`,cn:`住在隔壁的那些人`}]},{word:`home`,translation:`n. 家，住所; adv. 到家；在家`,phonetic:`hom`,partOfSpeech:`n / adv`,examples:[{en:`They have a beautiful home in California.`,cn:`他们在加州有个美丽的家。`},{en:`Good luck in your new home!`,cn:`祝你在新家一切顺利！`},{en:`A family of birds made their home (= started living ) under the roof.`,cn:`一窝鸟在屋顶下安了家。`}]},{word:`be good with…`,translation:`善于应付……的；对……有办法`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`make`,translation:`v. 制造`,phonetic:`mek`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I’m going to show you how to make a box for your tools.`,cn:`我来教你怎么做一个箱子存放工具。`},{en:`A family of mice had made their nest in the roof.`,cn:`一窝老鼠在屋顶上安了家。`},{en:`She made her own wedding dress.`,cn:`她的婚纱是自己做的。`},{en:`The company has been making quality furniture for over 200 years.`,cn:`这家公司制作优质家具有两百多年的历史了。`},{en:`They met while they were making a film.`,cn:`他们是在拍电影时认识的。`},{en:`Make a list of all the things you need.`,cn:`把你需要的所有物品列一份清单。`}]},{word:`make friends`,translation:`结交朋友`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Now I can go anywhere and make friends and find family.`,cn:`现在我可以去任何地方，结交朋友，寻找家人。`},{en:`Everyone needs friends, and if you fail to make friends, you should examine yourself and see if there is something wrong with your personality.`,cn:`人人都需要朋友，若你在交朋友方面总是失败，就该反省自己，看是否你的个性有什么问题。`}]},{word:`today`,translation:`adv. 在今天`,phonetic:`tə'de`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`I couldn’t go shopping yesterday so I’ll have to go today.`,cn:`我昨天没能去买东西，所以今天我必须去。`},{en:`Ed has his music lesson today.`,cn:`埃德今天有音乐课。`}]},{word:`help (sb) with sth`,translation:`在某方面帮助（某人）`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`center`,translation:`n. （centre的美式拼法）中心，中央`,phonetic:`'sɛntɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The builder designed a new shopping center for the company.`,cn:`那名设计者为该公司设计了一个新的购物中心。`},{en:`Whatever is at the center of your life is what you worship.`,cn:`你的生活中心无论是什么都是你所崇拜的那个。`}]},{word:`weekend`,translation:`n. 周末`,phonetic:`ˈwikend`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Are you doing anything nice this weekend?`,cn:`这个周末你有什么好的安排？`},{en:`Tony has been unwell over the weekend (= during the weekend ).`,cn:`托尼这个周末身体不舒服。`},{en:`We’re going to Paris for a long weekend (= Saturday and Sunday, and also Friday or Monday, or both ).`,cn:`我们要到巴黎去度一个长周末。`}]},{word:`on the weekend`,translation:`(在)周末`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`What do people do on the weekend?`,cn:`人们通常在周末做什么？`},{en:`Carrying a sleep debt throughout the week with the hopes of paying it off on the weekend is a bad strategy.`,cn:`工作日欠大量的睡眠债，而企图在周末一次补齐绝对是个坏主意。`}]},{word:`teach`,translation:`v. 教，讲授`,phonetic:`titʃ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She taught me fractions and counting.`,cn:`他教我分数和计算。`}]},{word:`musician`,translation:`n. 音乐家`,phonetic:`mjʊ'zɪʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a talented young musician`,cn:`有天赋的年轻音乐家`}]},{word:`up`,translation:`adv. 向上`,phonetic:`ʌp`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`We walked slowly up the hill.`,cn:`我们慢慢地爬上山。`},{en:`She picked her jacket up off the floor.`,cn:`她从地板上捡起外套。`},{en:`paths leading up into the mountains`,cn:`通往山里的小径`},{en:`Tim had climbed up a tree to get a better view.`,cn:`蒂姆爬到了树上，以便看得更清楚。`},{en:`Put up your hand if you know the answer.`,cn:`如果知道答案就举手。`},{en:`The water was getting up my nose.`,cn:`水已经没到了我的鼻子。`},{en:`Karen lay on her back, staring up at the ceiling.`,cn:`卡伦仰卧着，盯着天花板。`}]},{word:`get up`,translation:`站起；起床`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I got up and walked over to where he was.`,cn:`我站起来，走到他那里。`},{en:`They have to get up early in the morning.`,cn:`他们一大早就得起床。`}]},{word:`dress`,translation:`v. 穿衣服; n. 连衣裙`,phonetic:`drɛs`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Can you wait a minute? I’m just getting dressed .`,cn:`稍等一会儿，我穿下衣服就好。`},{en:`She dressed quickly and went out of the house.`,cn:`她很快穿好衣服，走到房子外面。`},{en:`I usually have to dress the kids in the mornings.`,cn:`早上我通常得给孩子们穿衣服。`}]},{word:`get dressed`,translation:`穿上衣服`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Why don't you get dressed now?`,cn:`你为什么现在还不穿好衣服？`},{en:`For me, the hardest part of a day is getting ready in the morning; I’d much rather sit down with a cup of joe and check my email than take a shower, get dressed, and take my son to daycare.`,cn:`对我来说，一天中最难的部分就是早晨上班前的准备；我更愿意坐下来喝上一杯咖啡，查看电邮，之后再洗个澡，穿好衣服，再送儿子去日托所。`},{en:`Grabbed me by my arm, had me get dressed, and drove me in to school.`,cn:`她抓着我的手臂，让我穿好衣服，然后开车送我去学校。`}]},{word:`brush`,translation:`v. 刷, 刷净; n. 刷子`,phonetic:`brʌʃ`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Don’t forget to brush your teeth.`,cn:`不要忘记刷牙。`}]},{word:`tooth`,translation:`n. (pl  teeth)牙齿`,phonetic:`tuθ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Sugar is bad for your teeth.`,cn:`糖对牙齿不好。`}]},{word:`shower`,translation:`n. 淋浴器（间）；淋浴; v. 洗淋浴`,phonetic:`'ʃaʊɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`Why does the phone always ring when I’m in the shower?`,cn:`为什么电话铃总是在我洗澡的时候响？`},{en:`I’d like to use the shower if that’s all right.`,cn:`如果可以的话，我想用一下这里的淋浴。`},{en:`The bathroom has a separate shower cubicle (= a shower in a separate part of the room ) .`,cn:`卫生间里有一个独立的淋浴间。`},{en:`I need a shower.`,cn:`我需要洗个淋浴。`},{en:`Mike shaved and showered.`,cn:`迈克刮了脸，冲了个淋浴。`}]},{word:`take a shower`,translation:`洗淋浴`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Our suggestion: Insist that everyone take a shower before hitting the pool. And make it a warm one.`,cn:`我们的建议是：坚持保证每个人入水前都先去冲个淋浴，而且要是热水的。`}]},{word:`usually`,translation:`adv. 通常地；一般地`,phonetic:`juʒəlɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Women usually live longer than men.`,cn:`女人通常比男人长寿。`},{en:`Usually I wear black, grey, or brown.`,cn:`通常我都穿黑色、灰色或者棕色的衣服。`},{en:`The drive usually takes 15 or 20 minutes.`,cn:`这段车程通常需要 15 或 20 分钟。`}]},{word:`forty`,translation:`num. 四十`,phonetic:`'fɔrti`,partOfSpeech:`num`,examples:[{en:`The place was built as a casino in the forties.`,cn:`这个地方建于20世纪40年代，起初是一座赌场。`}]},{word:`Wow`,translation:`intery. （表示惊奇或敬佩）哇；呀`,phonetic:`wou`,partOfSpeech:`intery`,examples:[{en:`Wow!What do you major in?`,cn:`哇哦！你的专业是什么?`},{en:`Wow! Can we try it?`,cn:`哇！ 我们能试试它么？`},{en:`It was hard to watch friends, or to watch people who I admired, up there performing and think to myself, 'Wow, I only know that now from here — from standing in the audience.`,cn:`斯泰普说，“看到朋友或是我崇拜的人在台上演出，想到‘哇，我对他们现在的了解的只是从现在，从站在听众里的这一刻开始。’ 这是自己很难接受的。”`}]},{word:`never`,translation:`adv. 从不；绝不`,phonetic:`'nɛvɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`He’s never been to Australia.`,cn:`他从未去过澳大利亚。`},{en:`I’m never going back there again, not as long as I live.`,cn:`只要我活着，我再也不会回到那儿去。`},{en:`It is never too late to give up smoking.`,cn:`戒烟不言晚。`},{en:`Never again (= never after a particular time ) would he return to Naples.`,cn:`他再也不会回到那不勒斯。`}]},{word:`early`,translation:`adj. 早（的）; adv. 提早，提前`,phonetic:`'ɝli`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`the early morning sunshine`,cn:`清晨的阳光`},{en:`an afternoon in early spring`,cn:`一个早春的午后`},{en:`In the early days, the railways mainly carried goods.`,cn:`最初，铁路主要用于运输货物。`},{en:`She is in her early twenties.`,cn:`她20岁出头。`},{en:`the recession of the early 1980s`,cn:`20世纪80年代初的经济衰退`},{en:`The money could be paid as early as next week.`,cn:`钱款最早可以在下周支付。`},{en:`He spent the early part of his career at St John’s Hospital.`,cn:`他在圣约翰医院度过了他的早期职业生涯。`},{en:`the experiences of early childhood`,cn:`幼年的经历`},{en:`the early works of Shakespeare`,cn:`莎士比亚的早期作品`},{en:`My earliest memories are of fruit trees.`,cn:`我最早的记忆和果树有关。`},{en:`Early signs are encouraging.`,cn:`早期的征兆鼓舞人心。`},{en:`We arrived early.`,cn:`我们提早到了。`}]},{word:`fifty`,translation:`num. 五十`,phonetic:`'fɪfti`,partOfSpeech:`num`,examples:[{en:`Standards of living rose in the fifties.`,cn:`50年代生活水平提高了。`}]},{word:`job`,translation:`n. 工作；职业`,phonetic:`dʒɒb`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Do you enjoy your job?`,cn:`你喜欢自己的工作吗？`},{en:`It was the first paid job I ever had.`,cn:`这是我第一份拿工资的工作。`},{en:`He’s been in the job for six years.`,cn:`他干这份工作有六年了。`},{en:`I’m looking for a new job.`,cn:`我在找一份新工作。`},{en:`Your pension can be affected if you change jobs.`,cn:`换工作的话，会影响到你的退休金。`}]},{word:`work`,translation:`v. 工作; n. 工作；职业`,phonetic:`wɝk`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Where do you work?`,cn:`你在哪里上班？`},{en:`Many young people in the area have never worked.`,cn:`该地区的许多年轻人从未工作过。`},{en:`The injury means he’ll probably never work again.`,cn:`这伤意味着他很有可能再也不能工作了。`},{en:`There isn’t a lot of work at this time of the year.`,cn:`每年这个时候工作机会都不多。`}]},{word:`station`,translation:`n. 车站；电视台`,phonetic:`ˈsteɪʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I want to get off at the next station.`,cn:`我要在下一站下车。`},{en:`Grand Central Station`,cn:`中央火车站`},{en:`Is there a waiting room in the station?`,cn:`车站里有候车室吗？`},{en:`the city bus station`,cn:`市内公共汽车站`},{en:`a local TV station`,cn:`一家当地电视台`}]},{word:`radio station`,translation:`n. 广播电台`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`MS. Foster’s dream of a country house began when she was in high school in Holbrook on Long Island, and her father, a radio announcer, tried to start his own radio station.`,cn:`“佛斯特”女士在长岛赫鲁布克上高中的时候就开始梦想有这样一所乡村别墅,那时,他的父亲是一名电台播音员,并且开始尝试自己做广播站。`}]},{word:`o'clock`,translation:`adv. （表示整点）…点钟`,phonetic:`ə'klɑk`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`It's already 9 o'clock.`,cn:`已经9点钟了。`},{en:`The meeting is at 10 o'clock.`,cn:`开会时间是10点钟。`}]},{word:`night`,translation:`n. 晚上；夜晚`,phonetic:`naɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It was a cold moonlit night.`,cn:`那是个寒冷的月夜。`},{en:`I didn’t sleep too well last night.`,cn:`我昨晚睡得不太好。`}]},{word:`funny`,translation:`adj. 滑稽好笑的`,phonetic:`'fʌni`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`the funniest man in Britain`,cn:`英国最滑稽的男人`},{en:`If this is your idea of a joke, I don’t find it at all funny .`,cn:`如果你觉得这是个玩笑，那我认为它一点也不好笑。`},{en:`Luckily, when I explained the situation, he saw the funny side (= recognized that it was partly funny ) .`,cn:`好在我把情况解释了以后，他看到了好笑的一面。`},{en:`His laughter stopped her mid-sentence. ‘ What’s so funny? ’ she demanded.`,cn:`他的笑声打断了她的话。“有什么好笑的？”她厉声问道。`},{en:`It’s not funny (= don’t laugh ) , Paul; poor Teresa was nearly in tears.`,cn:`没什么好笑的，保罗，可怜的特雷莎都快哭了。`}]},{word:`exercise`,translation:`n. 锻炼；练习，训练; v. 运动，锻炼(身体)`,phonetic:`'ɛksɚsaɪz`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`Try to fit some regular exercise into your daily routine.`,cn:`尽量在日常生活中安排一些经常性的锻炼。`},{en:`Working in an office, I don’t get much exercise.`,cn:`由于在办公室工作，我很少运动。`},{en:`relaxation exercises`,cn:`放松练习`},{en:`It’s important to exercise regularly.`,cn:`经常锻炼很重要。`}]},{word:`on weekends`,translation:`(在)周末`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`We should vote on weekends or make Election Day a national holiday.`,cn:`我们应当在周末投票，或让选举日成为一个国家假日。`},{en:`It will offer college preparatory classes and leadership courses even on weekends.`,cn:`它甚至将在周末提供大学预备课程和领导能力课程。`}]},{word:`best`,translation:`adj. 最好的; adv. 最好地`,phonetic:`bɛst`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`He won the best actor award.`,cn:`他获得最佳男演员奖。`},{en:`What’s the best way to cook this fish?`,cn:`这鱼怎么烧最好？`},{en:`The best thing to do is to stop worrying.`,cn:`最好的办法就是不要再担心。`},{en:`Our pilots are given the best possible training.`,cn:`我们的飞行员接受最好的训练。`},{en:`We use only the very best ingredients.`,cn:`我们只用最好的原料。`},{en:`It works best if you let it warm up first.`,cn:`如果先把它预热一下，使用效果最佳。`}]},{word:`half`,translation:`n. 一半，半数`,phonetic:`hæf`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Only half the guests had arrived by seven o’clock.`,cn:`7点钟前只来了一半客人。`},{en:`If you look at our members, at least half are women.`,cn:`看看我们的会员，至少有一半是女性。`}]},{word:`past`,translation:`prep. 晚于；过（时间）; adj. 过去的`,phonetic:`pæst`,partOfSpeech:`prep / adj`,examples:[{en:`It’s ten past nine.`,cn:`现在是九点十分。`},{en:`I should be finished by half past (= 30 minutes after the hour ) .`,cn:`我应该可以在30分钟之后完成。`},{en:`It was past midnight when the party ended.`,cn:`派对结束的时候已经过了午夜。`},{en:`Come on Annie, it’s long past your bedtime.`,cn:`快点，安妮，早就过了你的上床时间了。`}]},{word:`quarter`,translation:`n. 四分之一；一刻钟`,phonetic:`'kwɔrtɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It’s about a page and a quarter.`,cn:`大概是一又四分之一页。`},{en:`Cut the cake into quarters.`,cn:`把蛋糕切成四等份。`},{en:`I’ll meet you in a quarter of an hour.`,cn:`我们一刻钟之后见。`}]},{word:`homework`,translation:`n. 家庭作业`,phonetic:`'hom'wɝk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`For homework, finish the exercise on page 14.`,cn:`家庭作业是完成第14页的练习。`}]},{word:`do (one’s) homework`,translation:`做作业`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`run`,translation:`v. 跑；奔`,phonetic:`rʌn`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`A lot of language students want to run before they can walk.`,cn:`很多学习语言的学生都好高骛远。`}]},{word:`clean`,translation:`v. 打扫；弄干净；; adj. 干净的`,phonetic:`klin`,partOfSpeech:`v / adj`,examples:[{en:`Your shoes need cleaning .`,cn:`你的鞋该刷一刷了。`},{en:`Is it easy to clean ?`,cn:`清理起来容易吗？`}]},{word:`walk`,translation:`v. 行走；步行; n. 散步`,phonetic:`wɔk`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`‘How did you get here?’ ‘We walked.’`,cn:`“你们是怎么来这里的？”“我们是步行来的。”`},{en:`Doctors said he’d never walk again.`,cn:`医生说他再也不能行走了。`},{en:`He loved walking in the hills.`,cn:`他喜欢在山里散步。`},{en:`I walked all the way to San Rafael.`,cn:`我一路走到圣拉斐尔。`},{en:`I went for a walk.`,cn:`我去散步了。`}]},{word:`take a walk`,translation:`散步；走一走`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`When I ask why, their face clouds with frustration. That there just isn't time to sit back and watch the sun set or take a walk in the park is a common response.`,cn:`当我问他们为什么会这样的时候，他们脸上露出了沮丧的表情，普遍的回答是没有时间去舒适地休息一下，甚至没有时间观看日升日落亦或是在公园里散散步。`}]},{word:`quickly`,translation:`adv. 很快地`,phonetic:`'kwɪkli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`We need to get this finished as quickly as possible.`,cn:`我们必须尽快完成此事。`},{en:`Kids grow up so quickly these days.`,cn:`现在的孩子长得真快啊。`}]},{word:`either`,translation:`adv. 也(不) （用在否定词组后）`,phonetic:`'iðɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`I haven’t seen the movie and my brother hasn’t either (= he also has not seen it ).`,cn:`我没看过这部电影，我弟弟也没看过。`},{en:`‘I can’t swim.’ ‘I can’t either.’`,cn:`“我不会游泳。”“我也不会。`},{en:`It’s not an easy car to drive, and at $40,000 it’s not cheap either.`,cn:`这车不容易开，而且要价4万美元，也不便宜。`}]},{word:`Either…or ……`,translation:`要么……要么……；或者……或者……`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`lot`,translation:`pron. 大量；许多`,phonetic:`lɑt`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`We’ve spent a lot on the children’s education.`,cn:`我们在孩子的教育上花费甚多。`},{en:`‘How many CDs have you got?’ ‘Lots.’`,cn:`“你有多少张CD？”“多着呢。”`}]},{word:`lots of`,translation:`大量；许多`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`There are lots of pear trees near the house.`,cn:`屋子近旁种着许多梨树。`},{en:`There were lots of tourists rubbernecking in the street.`,cn:`许多游客在大街上伸长了脖子东张西望。`},{en:`We have lots of engineers, and lots of scientists.`,cn:`我们有许多的工程师和科学家。`}]},{word:`sometimes`,translation:`adv. 有时`,phonetic:`'sʌmtaɪmz`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`I sometimes have to work late.`,cn:`我有时得工作到很晚。`},{en:`Sometimes, Grandma would tell us stories about her childhood in Italy.`,cn:`有时候，祖母会跟我们讲讲她儿时在意大利的经历。`},{en:`‘Do you ever wish you were back in Japan?’ ‘Sometimes. Not very often.’`,cn:`“你有没有想过希望回到日本？”“有时候吧，但不经常这么想。”`},{en:`The journey takes an hour, sometimes even longer.`,cn:`路上需要一小时，有时甚至更长。`}]},{word:`taste`,translation:`v. 有…的味道；品尝; n. 味道；滋味`,phonetic:`test`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`The food tasted better than it looked.`,cn:`这食物吃起来味道比看上去要好。`},{en:`What does pumpkin taste like (= how would you describe its taste ) ?`,cn:`南瓜是什么味道？`},{en:`The medicine had a slightly bitter taste.`,cn:`这药略带苦味。`}]},{word:`Life`,translation:`n. 生命；生活`,phonetic:`laɪf`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`...a baby's first minutes of life.`,cn:`…婴儿生命的头几分钟。`},{en:`My personal life has had to take second place to my career.`,cn:`我的个人生活不得不放在我的事业之后。`},{en:`Amnesty International opposes the death penalty as a violation of the right to life.`,cn:`大赦国际组织反对死刑，因其侵犯生存权。`}]},{word:`train`,translation:`n. 火车`,phonetic:`tren`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We went all the way to Inverness by train.`,cn:`我们一路坐火车到因弗内斯。`}]},{word:`bus`,translation:`n. 公交车`,phonetic:`bʌs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I took a bus to San Francisco.`,cn:`我乘公共汽车去旧金山。`},{en:`Buses run at 15 and 30 minutes past the hour.`,cn:`公共汽车在每小时的15分和30分时发车。`}]},{word:`subway`,translation:`n. 地铁`,phonetic:`'sʌbwe`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the New York City subway`,cn:`纽约市的地铁`},{en:`a crowded subway station`,cn:`拥挤的地铁站`},{en:`Boston has the oldest subway system in the US.`,cn:`波士顿拥有美国最老的地铁运输系统。`}]},{word:`take the subway`,translation:`乘地铁`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`You could take the subway.`,cn:`你可以乘地铁去。`},{en:`You can take the subway near your hotel.`,cn:`你可以在宾馆附近乘地铁。`}]},{word:`ride`,translation:`v. 骑; n. 旅行`,phonetic:`raɪd`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`She learned to ride when she was seven.`,cn:`她七岁时学会了骑马。`},{en:`He was riding a large grey mare.`,cn:`他骑着一匹灰色的大母马。`}]},{word:`bike`,translation:`n. 自行车`,phonetic:`baɪk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Let’s go for a bike ride .`,cn:`我们去骑会儿自行车吧。`}]},{word:`ride a bike`,translation:`骑自行车`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`CNN gives this, as well as other perks, to employees who walk or ride a bike to work.`,cn:`CNN给了我这些，还有其他一些津贴，用于奖励步行或者骑自行车上班的雇员。`},{en:`The court heard that Glen could walk, run and ride a bike, and was excited by police cars and fire engines, but he did not talk.`,cn:`法院了解到，格林能走能跑、会骑自行车，看见警车和消防车就雀跃，但却无法和人交谈。`},{en:`As you build strength and stamina, walk faster or farther, lift weights, ride a bike, or try a class at a local gym or yoga studio.`,cn:`当你身体变得强壮和更具持久力时，可以走得时间长些距离远些，练习下举重，骑骑自行车，或者尝试在当地体育馆或瑜伽社报个班。`}]},{word:`sixty`,translation:`num. 六十`,phonetic:`'sɪksti`,partOfSpeech:`num`,examples:[{en:`sixty years ago`,cn:`六十年前`}]},{word:`seventy`,translation:`num. 七十`,phonetic:`'sɛvnti`,partOfSpeech:`num`,examples:[{en:`We lost touch during the seventies.`,cn:`我们在70年代失去了联系。`}]},{word:`eighty`,translation:`num. 八十`,phonetic:`ˈeti`,partOfSpeech:`num`,examples:[{en:`The band was incredibly successful in the eighties.`,cn:`这支乐队在80年代红透半边天。`}]},{word:`ninety`,translation:`num. 九十`,phonetic:`'naɪnti`,partOfSpeech:`num`,examples:[{en:`America was far richer in the nineties.`,cn:`90年代的美国要富裕得多。`}]},{word:`hundred`,translation:`num. 一百`,phonetic:`'hʌndrəd`,partOfSpeech:`num`,examples:[{en:`The tree was probably a hundred years old.`,cn:`这棵树很可能已经有100年了。`}]},{word:`minute`,translation:`n. 分钟`,phonetic:`'mɪnɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It takes me ten minutes to walk to work.`,cn:`我步行上班要用十分钟。`},{en:`The train arrived at four minutes past eight.`,cn:`火车于八点零四分到达。`},{en:`He returned a few minutes later.`,cn:`几分钟后他回来了。`},{en:`I’ll meet you at the car in five minutes.`,cn:`五分钟后我在车那儿和你见面。`}]},{word:`far`,translation:`adj. 远；远的; adv. 远；用于表示进展情况或影响程度`,phonetic:`fɑr`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`You could see the mountains in the far distance.`,cn:`你可以看到远处的群山`},{en:`Have you driven far?`,cn:`你开了很远了吗？`},{en:`He started to explain, but he didn’t get far (= he did not succeed in saying very much ) before Mary interrupted him.`,cn:`他开始解释起来，但没说几句就被玛丽打断了。`},{en:`Many people felt that the new law did not go far enough (= did not have a big enough effect, so that more needed to be done ) .`,cn:`许多人认为新的法律力度不够。`}]},{word:`kilometer`,translation:`n. 公里（等于kilometre）`,phonetic:`ˈkɪləˌmitɚ; kəˈlɑmətɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She had to battle snowstorms, landslides, snakes and loneliness on her 350 kilometer journey.`,cn:`在350公里的行程中，她要克服暴风雪、滑坡、蛇和孤独寂寞。`},{en:`For example, the researchers last week said they had managed to gather enough energy from a TV station a half-kilometer away to power a small temperature sensor.`,cn:`例如，研究人员上周说，他们已经设法从半公里远的一座电视发射台收集了足够了能量给一个小型温度传感器供电。`}]},{word:`new`,translation:`adj. 新的；刚出现的`,phonetic:`nu`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`the city’s new hospital`,cn:`市里新建的医院`},{en:`the new issue of ‘Time’ magazine`,cn:`新一期《时代周刊》`},{en:`new products on the market`,cn:`市场上的新产品`},{en:`The hardest part of this job is understanding the new technology.`,cn:`这项工作最难的地方是理解新技术。`},{en:`a new range of drugs`,cn:`一系列新药`}]},{word:`every`,translation:`adj. 每一；每个`,phonetic:`'ɛvri`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`His every utterance will be scrutinized.`,cn:`他说的每句话都会被细查。`}]},{word:`every day`,translation:`每天`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`He catlicks his face every day.`,cn:`他每天马马虎虎地洗脸。`},{en:`They mucked up the floor every day.`,cn:`他们每天都把地板弄脏。`},{en:`They commute between Beijing and Tianjin every day.`,cn:`他们每天往返于北京与天津之间。`}]},{word:`by`,translation:`prep. 由谁/什么做某事`,phonetic:`baɪ`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`I was attacked by a dog.`,cn:`我被一条狗袭击。`}]},{word:`by bike`,translation:`骑自行车`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Do you go to school by bus or by bike?`,cn:`你去学校是乘巴士还是骑单车呢？`},{en:`She usually goes to work by bike except on rainy days.`,cn:`除了雨天之外， 她总是骑自行车上班。`},{en:`So the week after Easter we set off by bike on a four-day trip to Wimpfen, Amorbach, and Miltenberg.`,cn:`因此复活节后那个星期我们骑自行车出发去温普芬，阿莫巴赫和米尔藤贝格进行为期四天的旅行。`}]},{word:`drive`,translation:`v. 开车`,phonetic:`draɪv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`the man driving the car`,cn:`开车的男子`},{en:`Can you drive?`,cn:`你会开车吗？`},{en:`So when did you learn to drive ?`,cn:`那么你是什么时候学会开车的？`},{en:`Bye! Drive carefully!`,cn:`再见！开车小心！`},{en:`He drives 12 miles to work.`,cn:`他驾车12英里去上班。`},{en:`He drives (= has ) a BMW estate.`,cn:`他开一辆宝马旅行车。`}]},{word:`car`,translation:`n. 小汽车；轿车`,phonetic:`kɑr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Dan got out of the car and locked the door.`,cn:`丹下了车，锁上车门。`},{en:`He isn’t old enough to drive a car.`,cn:`他还未到可以开车的年龄。`},{en:`Coughlan was killed in a car accident.`,cn:`科赫兰死于一场车祸。`}]},{word:`live`,translation:`v. 居住；生活`,phonetic:`laɪv；lɪv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`He lives just across the street from me.`,cn:`他就住在我街对面。`},{en:`We live only a few miles from the coast.`,cn:`我们住的地方离海边只有几英里远。`},{en:`A rather odd family came tolive next door to us.`,cn:`有一户相当奇怪的人家搬到了我们隔壁。`},{en:`As soon as I saw the place, I knew I didn’t want to live there.`,cn:`我一看到那地方，就觉得不想住在那儿。`},{en:`Does Paul stilllive here?`,cn:`保罗还住在这儿吗？`},{en:`We’re still looking for somewhere to live.`,cn:`我们还在找住的地方。`},{en:`They’ve finally found a place to live.`,cn:`他们终于找到了住的地方。`},{en:`Most seventeen-year-olds still live at home(= live with their parents ).`,cn:`17 岁的孩子大都还住在家里。`},{en:`I’m quite happy living alone.`,cn:`我一个人住很开心。`},{en:`The house has 3,600 square feet of living space(= the areas of a house you live in ).`,cn:`这房子有3,600平方英尺的居住空间。`},{en:`He lived in the eighteenth century.`,cn:`他生活在18世纪。`}]},{word:`stop`,translation:`n. 车站；停止`,phonetic:`stɑp`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Our next stop will be York.`,cn:`我们下一站是约克。`},{en:`Work on the project has come to a stop because of lack of funding.`,cn:`由于缺乏资金，这个项目已经停工。`}]},{word:`think of`,translation:`认为`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`cross`,translation:`v. 横过；越过`,phonetic:`krɔs`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`He crossed to the window.`,cn:`他穿过去走到窗边。`},{en:`He raised his arms in triumph as he crossed the line for his 100-metres win.`,cn:`他以胜利的姿态高举双手跑过终点线，赢得了这场百米赛。`}]},{word:`river`,translation:`n. 河；江`,phonetic:`'rɪvɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the Mississippi River`,cn:`密西西比河`},{en:`the River Thames`,cn:`泰晤士河`}]},{word:`many`,translation:`pron & adj. 许多`,phonetic:`'mɛni`,partOfSpeech:`pron & adj`,examples:[{en:`Among his many hobbies was the breeding of fine horses.`,cn:`在他的众多爱好中有饲养名马。`}]},{word:`village`,translation:`n. 村庄；村镇`,phonetic:`'vɪlɪdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a little fishing village`,cn:`一座小渔村`}]},{word:`between`,translation:`prep. 介于…之间`,phonetic:`bəˈtwin`,partOfSpeech:`prep`},{word:`between… and…`,translation:`在……和……之间`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`bridge`,translation:`n. 桥`,phonetic:`brɪdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He walked back over the railway bridge.`,cn:`他从铁路桥上走了回去。`}]},{word:`boat`,translation:`n. 小船`,phonetic:`bot`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a fishing boat`,cn:`渔船`},{en:`The boat capsized (=  turned over  ) in heavy seas.`,cn:`船在波涛汹涌的大海上倾覆了。`},{en:`a boat trip around the islands`,cn:`乘船环岛旅行`}]},{word:`ropeway`,translation:`n. 索道`,phonetic:`'rəupwei`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`year`,translation:`n. 年；岁`,phonetic:`yir`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I arrived here two years ago.`,cn:`我两年前来到这里。`},{en:`We’ve known each other for over a year.`,cn:`我们相识一年多了。`},{en:`It’s almost a year since Sue died.`,cn:`休去世快一年了。`},{en:`Jodi is 15 years old.`,cn:`约迪15岁。`},{en:`a three-year business plan`,cn:`三年的业务发展计划`},{en:`a four-year-old child`,cn:`四岁的孩子`}]},{word:`afraid`,translation:`adj. 害怕；惧怕`,phonetic:`ə'fred`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`There’s no need to be afraid.`,cn:`没有必要害怕。`}]},{word:`like`,translation:`prep. 像`,phonetic:`laɪk`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`Her hair is dark brown like mine.`,cn:`她的头发是深褐色的，和我的一样。`},{en:`A club should be like a big family.`,cn:`俱乐部就应该像一个大家庭。`},{en:`He eats like a pig!`,cn:`他吃东西像猪一样！`},{en:`My experience is very much like that described in the book.`,cn:`我的经历很像这本书上说的那样。`},{en:`He’s very like his brother.`,cn:`他很像他的哥哥。`},{en:`Sometimes you sound just like (= exactly like ) my mum!`,cn:`有时候你听上去简直就像我妈！`},{en:`He’s growing more like his father every day.`,cn:`他一天比一天长得更像他的父亲。`},{en:`He looked nothing like (= not at all like ) the man in the police photograph.`,cn:`他看上去一点也不像警方照片上的那个人。`}]},{word:`leave`,translation:`v. 离开`,phonetic:`liv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`My baby gets upset when I leave the room.`,cn:`我一离开房间宝宝就会不安。`},{en:`Before leaving the train, make sure you have all your belongings with you.`,cn:`下火车前一定要带好随身物品。`},{en:`Leave the motorway at Junction 7.`,cn:`请在七号交叉路口驶离高速公路。`},{en:`My youngest boy has not left my side (= has stayed near me ) since his daddy was killed.`,cn:`我最小的儿子自从他爸爸死后就没有离开过我的身边。`}]},{word:`dream`,translation:`n. 睡梦；梦想; v. 做梦`,phonetic:`drim`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`I had lots of dreams last night.`,cn:`昨晚我做了很多梦。`},{en:`Her dream is to make a movie.`,cn:`她的梦想是要拍一部电影。`},{en:`Ivor dreamed that he was on a bus.`,cn:`艾弗梦见了他在公共汽车上。`}]},{word:`true`,translation:`adj. 真的；符合事实的`,phonetic:`tru`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`No, honestly, it’s a true story .`,cn:`不，真的，这是一个真实的故事。`},{en:`Students decide if statements are true or false .`,cn:`由学生来判断说法正确还是错误。`},{en:`It’s generally true to say that fewer people are needed nowadays.`,cn:`总的来说现在需要的人员少了。`},{en:`The results appear to hold true (= still be correct ) for other countries.`,cn:`这些结果在其他国家似乎同样正确。`}]},{word:`come true`,translation:`实现；成为现实`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`rule`,translation:`n. 规则；规章`,phonetic:`rul`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There are no hard and fast rules (= clear and definite rules ) about what to wear to classes.`,cn:`对于上课着装并没有硬性规定。`}]},{word:`arrive`,translation:`v. 到达`,phonetic:`ə'raɪv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Give me a call to let me know you’ve arrived safely.`,cn:`打个电话给我，告诉我你已平安到达。`},{en:`By the time the police arrived on the scene, the burglars had fled.`,cn:`警方赶到现场时，窃贼已经逃跑了。`}]},{word:`(be) on time`,translation:`准时`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`hallway`,translation:`n. 走廊；过道`,phonetic:`'hɔlwe`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They took the lift up to the third floor and walked along the quiet hallway.`,cn:`他们乘电梯到了3楼，然后走过寂静的过道。`}]},{word:`hall`,translation:`n. 大厅；礼堂`,phonetic:`hɔl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a concert at Carnegie Hall`,cn:`卡内基音乐厅的一场音乐会`}]},{word:`dining hall`,translation:`n. 餐厅`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The next morning, each one went down to get breakfast in the dining hall of their respective dorms.`,cn:`第二天早上，男女双方径直回到自己的宿舍餐厅吃早饭。`}]},{word:`listen`,translation:`v. 听；倾听`,phonetic:`'lɪsn`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Listen! There’s a strange noise in the engine.`,cn:`听！引擎发出奇怪的声音。`}]},{word:`listen to…`,translation:`听……`,phonetic:`lɪsn tʊ`,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`fight`,translation:`v. 打（仗）；与（…）作战；战斗; n. 打斗，打架`,phonetic:`faɪt`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Neither country is capable of fighting a long war .`,cn:`两个国家都没有能力打持久战。`},{en:`Later the Indians fought the Anglo settlers.`,cn:`后来，印第安人跟英国殖民者打起了仗。`},{en:`Her son was always getting into fights at school.`,cn:`她儿子老是在学校打架。`}]},{word:`sorry`,translation:`adj. 抱歉的；；难过的；惋惜的`,phonetic:`'sɔri`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`She was very sorry about all the trouble she'd caused.`,cn:`她对自己造成的麻烦感到很内疚。`},{en:`I’ve got no sympathy for him, but I feel sorry for his wife.`,cn:`我并不同情他，但我为他妻子感到惋惜。`}]},{word:`outside`,translation:`adv. 在外面; adj. 外面的`,phonetic:`,aʊt'saɪd`,partOfSpeech:`adv / adj`,examples:[{en:`When we got up, it was still dark outside.`,cn:`我们起床时，外面天还没亮。`},{en:`We turned off the outside lights and went to bed.`,cn:`我们关掉外头的电灯，上床睡觉了。`}]},{word:`wear`,translation:`v. 穿；戴`,phonetic:`wɛr`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Susanna was wearing a black silk dress.`,cn:`苏珊娜穿着一条黑色真丝连衣裙。`},{en:`He wore glasses for reading.`,cn:`他阅读时戴眼镜。`}]},{word:`important`,translation:`adj. 重要的`,phonetic:`ɪm'pɔrtnt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a very important meeting`,cn:`很重要的会议`},{en:`The accident taught him an important lesson.`,cn:`那次事故给了他很大的教训。`},{en:`Happiness is more important than money.`,cn:`快乐比金钱更重要。`},{en:`‘What did you say?’ ‘Oh, nothing important.’`,cn:`“你说什么？”“噢，没什么大事。”`},{en:`It’s vitally important that you understand the danger.`,cn:`了解危险所在是极为重要的。`}]},{word:`bring`,translation:`v. 带来；取来`,phonetic:`brɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The expansion of state education brought new and wider opportunities for working class children.`,cn:`公立教育的普及为工人阶层出身的儿童带来了更多新的机会。`}]},{word:`uniform`,translation:`n. 校服；制服`,phonetic:`junəˌfɔrm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The police wear dark blue uniforms.`,cn:`警察穿深蓝色制服。`}]},{word:`quiet`,translation:`adj. 安静的`,phonetic:`'kwaɪət`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`We’ll have to be quiet so as not to wake the baby.`,cn:`我们得安静点，免得吵醒宝宝。`},{en:`It’s a nice car. The engine’s really quiet.`,cn:`这车真好，发动机声音很小。`},{en:`I’ll be as quiet as a mouse (= very quiet ).`,cn:`我会像老鼠一样悄无声息的。`}]},{word:`out`,translation:`adv. 外出`,phonetic:`aʊt`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`She opened her suitcase and took out a pair of shoes.`,cn:`她打开手提箱，拿出一双鞋。`},{en:`Lock the door on your way out.`,cn:`你出去时把门锁上。`},{en:`Charlotte went to the window and looked out.`,cn:`夏洛特走到窗前往外看。`},{en:`Out you go (= used to order someone to leave a room )!`,cn:`你给我出去！`}]},{word:`go out`,translation:`外出（娱乐）`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I'm going out tonight.`,cn:`我今晚要出去玩。`}]},{word:`practice`,translation:`n. 练习`,phonetic:`'præktɪs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It takes hours of practice to learn to play the guitar.`,cn:`学习弹吉他需要长时间的练习。`},{en:`With a little more practice you should be able to pass your test.`,cn:`稍微再练一练，你应该能通过考试了。`},{en:`We have choir practice on Tuesday evening.`,cn:`星期二晚上我们要练习合唱。`}]},{word:`dish`,translation:`n. 碟；盘`,phonetic:`dɪʃ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a serving dish`,cn:`上菜用的盘子`},{en:`an ovenproof dish`,cn:`耐热盘`}]},{word:`do the dishes`,translation:`清洗餐具`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Now, if only these phones were smart enough to do the dishes.`,cn:`现在要是这些电话有足够的智能来清洗餐具该有多好。`},{en:`A batch of things to do in an hour today may look like this: Clean your desk / answer today’s emails / do the dishes / make three calls / write a grocery shopping list for tomorrow.`,cn:`今天在一个小时里的要做的一批事情就像是这样：清理你的桌子/回复今天的邮件/洗餐具/打三个电话/写明天去食品店的购物清单`}]},{word:`before`,translation:`prep. 在…以前; adv. 以前`,phonetic:`bɪ'fɔr`,partOfSpeech:`prep / adv`,examples:[{en:`The new road should be completed before the end of the year.`,cn:`这条新公路应该在年底前完工。`},{en:`Let’s meet at our house before the show.`,cn:`看演出前在我们家碰头吧。`},{en:`Larry arrived home before me.`,cn:`拉里在我之前到家。`},{en:`We only got back from Scotland the day before yesterday (=  two days ago  ) .`,cn:`我们前天才从苏格兰回来。`},{en:`Other students joined in the protest, and before long (=  soon  ) there was a crowd of 200 or so.`,cn:`其他学生也加入了抗议队伍，不久就有200人左右了。`}]},{word:`make (one’s) bed`,translation:`铺床`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`dirty`,translation:`adj. 脏的`,phonetic:`ˈdɝ​tɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a stack of dirty dishes in the sink`,cn:`洗涤槽里的一堆脏碟子`},{en:`How did you get so dirty?`,cn:`你怎么会弄得这么脏？`}]},{word:`kitchen`,translation:`n. 厨房`,phonetic:`'kɪtʃɪn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Sam went into the kitchen to make a pot of tea.`,cn:`萨姆走进厨房去沏一壶茶。`},{en:`She is in the kitchen making a meal.`,cn:`她在厨房里做饭。`}]},{word:`more`,translation:`pron. 更多的`,phonetic:`mɔr`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`Let me adduce more evidence.`,cn:`让我举出更多的证据。`},{en:`We ought to and can produce more petroleum.`,cn:`我们应该并且能够生产更多的石油。`},{en:`The film deserves more attention from the public.`,cn:`这部影片应受到公众的更多注意。`}]},{word:`noisy`,translation:`adj. 吵闹的`,phonetic:`ˈnɔɪzɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The kids have been really noisy today.`,cn:`孩子们今天实在是吵。`},{en:`a noisy engine`,cn:`噪声大的发动机`}]},{word:`relax`,translation:`v. 放松；休息`,phonetic:`rɪ'læks`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I just want to sit down and relax.`,cn:`我只想坐下来休息一下。`},{en:`What Robyn needed was a drink to relax her.`,cn:`萝宾需要的是喝一杯放松放松。`},{en:`A hot bath should help to relax you.`,cn:`洗个热水澡可以帮助你放松下来。`}]},{word:`read`,translation:`v. 读；阅读`,phonetic:`rid; rɛd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I can’t read your writing.`,cn:`我看不懂你写的东西。`},{en:`She picked up the letter and read it.`,cn:`她拿起信读了起来。`},{en:`Read the instructions carefully before you start.`,cn:`开始前要仔细阅读说明。`},{en:`children who are just learning to read and write`,cn:`刚刚开始学习读和写的儿童`},{en:`Her books are quite widely read (= read by a lot of people ) .`,cn:`她的书读者很多。`},{en:`When I was young, I read every one of his books from cover to cover (= read all of something because you are very interested ) .`,cn:`我小时候，他的每一本书我都从头到尾一页不落地看过。`}]},{word:`terrible`,translation:`adj. 非常讨厌的；可怕的`,phonetic:`'tɛrəbl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Their son had been injured in a terrible accident.`,cn:`他们的儿子在一次严重事故中受过伤。`},{en:`We’re worried that something terrible might have happened to Greg.`,cn:`我们担心格雷格有可能遇到了什么可怕的事情。`},{en:`a terrible storm`,cn:`猛烈的暴风雨`}]},{word:`feel`,translation:`v. 感受；觉得`,phonetic:`fil`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Do you still feel hungry?`,cn:`你还觉得饿吗？`},{en:`You can never tell what he’s feeling.`,cn:`他的感受你永远说不准。`},{en:`Stop exercising if you feel any pain.`,cn:`要是感到疼痛就停止练习。`},{en:`I felt like I’d really achieved something.`,cn:`我感觉自己真的有所成就了。`}]},{word:`strict`,translation:`adj. 严格的；严厉的`,phonetic:`strɪkt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a strict teacher`,cn:`严格的老师`}]},{word:`be strict (with sb)`,translation:`（对某人）要求严格`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`remember`,translation:`v. 记住； 记起`,phonetic:`rɪ'mɛmbɚ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Do you remember Rosa Davies?`,cn:`你记得罗莎·戴维斯吗？`},{en:`I can’t remember her exact words.`,cn:`我记不得她的原话了。`},{en:`I remember it well ; I’d never seen my mother so angry.`,cn:`这件事我记得很清楚；我从未见过母亲这么生气。`},{en:`She clearly remembers the excitement as they boarded the train.`,cn:`她清楚地记得他们登上火车时的激动心情。`},{en:`I vaguely remember reading something about it in the paper.`,cn:`我隐约记得在报纸上看到过有关情况。`},{en:`They had three children, if I remember rightly .`,cn:`如果我没记错，他们有三个孩子。`},{en:`They’ve lived here for as long as I can remember .`,cn:`在我记忆中他们一直都住在这儿。`},{en:`No one got drunk as far as I can remember .`,cn:`我记得当时没有人喝醉酒。`}]},{word:`follow`,translation:`v. 跟随；遵循`,phonetic:`'fɑlo`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Are those men following us?`,cn:`那些人在跟着我们吗？`},{en:`The patrol car followed the BMW for a few miles and then lost it.`,cn:`巡逻车跟了那辆宝马几英里，后来就跟丢了。`},{en:`Tom’s already gone out to Rome and his wife and children will follow shortly.`,cn:`汤姆已经去罗马了，他的妻儿很快就会跟着去。`},{en:`He followed the doctor’s advice and had no further trouble.`,cn:`他听从了医生的建议，就没有再出现问题。`}]},{word:`follow the rules`,translation:`遵守规则`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Those nations that follow the rules will find greater security and opportunity.`,cn:`遵守规则的国家将得到更大的安全保障和机会。`},{en:`Another is that they know they are on camera. "When you're visible, you're more likely to follow the rules," he adds.`,cn:`另一个是他们知道他们处于被监控状态。“当你被人看见时，你更有可能遵守规则。”他又补充道。`},{en:`When you follow the rules, life works.`,cn:`当你遵守规则，生活就会顺心。`}]},{word:`luck`,translation:`n. 幸运；运气`,phonetic:`lʌk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`You’re not having much luck today, are you?`,cn:`你今天运气不太好，是不是？`},{en:`He’s had good luck with his roses this year.`,cn:`今年他种玫瑰的运气不错。`},{en:`It was an incredible piece of luck.`,cn:`真是令人难以置信的好运气。`}]},{word:`keep`,translation:`v. 保持；保留`,phonetic:`kip`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`We huddled around the fire to keep warm.`,cn:`我们挤在火堆边取暖。`},{en:`You can keep it. I don’t need it any more.`,cn:`你留着吧，我不需要了。`}]},{word:`hair`,translation:`n. 头发；毛发`,phonetic:`hɛr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Her hair was short and dark.`,cn:`她的头发又短又黑。`},{en:`a short fat man with no hair on his head`,cn:`光头的矮胖男人`}]},{word:`learn`,translation:`v. 学习；学会`,phonetic:`lɝn`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`What’s the best way to learn a language?`,cn:`学习语言的最佳方法是什么？`},{en:`The teacher’s task is to help the pupil learn.`,cn:`老师的任务是帮助学生学习。`},{en:`The student will learn from experience about the importance of planning.`,cn:`学生将从经验中学到制订计划的重要性。`}]},{word:`panda`,translation:`n. 熊猫`,phonetic:`'pændə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The caged panda chafed against the bars.`,cn:`笼子里的大熊猫贴在栅栏上蹭它的身体。`},{en:`No. If the panda  has not quit by morning .`,cn:`不，如果明天早上那熊猫还不走`}]},{word:`zoo`,translation:`n. 动物园`,phonetic:`zu`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They taxied to the zoo.`,cn:`他们乘出租车去动物园。`},{en:`The parrots in the zoo are popping all the time.`,cn:`动物园里的鹦鹉一直在生小鹦鹉。`},{en:`He then adds the usual caveat: "But, as a zoo director, I understand that it is absolutely essential that we keep them there.`,cn:`接着他补充一贯的说明：“但是，作为一个动物园园长，我明白我们将它们放在那里是绝对必要的。”`}]},{word:`tiger`,translation:`n. 老虎`,phonetic:`'taɪɡɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`A tiger lives off some small animals.`,cn:`老虎靠吃一些小动物为生。`},{en:`The magician transformed the girl into a tiger.`,cn:`魔术师把那个女孩变成了一头老虎。`}]},{word:`elephant`,translation:`n. 大象`,phonetic:`ˈɛləfənt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The hunter destroyed the elephant.`,cn:`猎手射杀了那头大象。`},{en:`Big extinct birds such as the giant moa,thunderbirds and elephant birds all left eggshells behind them.`,cn:`像恐鸟、雷鸟和象鸟这样已经灭绝的鸟类都留下了它们的蛋壳化石。`},{en:`No. Although 75% of its raw materials is elephant dung, it is light delicate fragrance instead of stink. This is due to its special fabrication technology.`,cn:`不，尽管这种纸里75％的原料都是大象的粪便，但它不但不臭，反而有一种淡淡的清香，这是源于它的特殊的制造工艺。`}]},{word:`koala`,translation:`n. 树袋熊`,phonetic:`ko'ɑlə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`No thanks to the koala.`,cn:`真要感谢那只树熊？！`},{en:`Dropbears - Dropbears are an evil species of koala that fall from trees and attack humans.`,cn:`无尾熊--无尾熊是属于一种树袋熊类的邪恶物种，它专门跳下树攻击人类。`}]},{word:`lion`,translation:`n. 狮子`,phonetic:`'laɪən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The wounded lion bellowed out.`,cn:`受伤的狮子发出了怒吼。`},{en:`The lion bounded on the prey.`,cn:`那头狮子向猎物猛扑过去。`},{en:`The savages darted spears at the lion.`,cn:`野蛮人们把矛掷向狮子。`}]},{word:`giraffe`,translation:`n. 长颈鹿`,phonetic:`dʒəˈræf; dʒəˈræf`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Can I get the mommy giraffe for Christmas?`,cn:`我在圣诞节能得到一个长颈鹿妈妈吗？`},{en:`If so, find you a giraffe of some sort and put it out in the fall.`,cn:`如果是这样的话，拿出你的长颈鹿并把它在秋天里展示出来。`}]},{word:`animal`,translation:`n. 动物`,phonetic:`'ænɪml`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`furry little animals`,cn:`毛茸茸的小动物`},{en:`The cosmetics have not been tested on animals.`,cn:`这些化妆品没有进行过动物试验。`},{en:`Beth is an animal lover (=  someone who likes animals  ) .`,cn:`贝丝是个喜欢动物的人。`}]},{word:`cute`,translation:`adj. 可爱的；机灵的`,phonetic:`kjʊt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a cute little puppy`,cn:`一只逗人爱的小狗`},{en:`The baby’s so cute.`,cn:`这婴儿真可爱。`},{en:`That’s a really cute outfit.`,cn:`那套衣服真漂亮。`}]},{word:`lazy`,translation:`adj. 懒散的；懒惰的`,phonetic:`ˈlezɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`the laziest boy in the class`,cn:`班上最懒的男孩`},{en:`He felt too lazy to get out of bed.`,cn:`他懒得都不想起床。`}]},{word:`smart`,translation:`adj. 聪明的`,phonetic:`smɑrt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The smart kids get good grades and go off to college.`,cn:`聪明的孩子成绩好，可以去上大学。`},{en:`I was smart enough to wait for a week.`,cn:`我很明智，等了一个星期。`},{en:`His decision to become a director was a smart move (= sensible thing to do ) .`,cn:`他决定要做导演，这是明智之举。`}]},{word:`beautiful`,translation:`adj. 美丽的；美好的`,phonetic:`'bjʊtəfəl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`She was even more beautiful than I had remembered.`,cn:`她比我记忆中更美。`},{en:`a beautiful bunch of flowers`,cn:`一束美丽的花`}]},{word:`scary`,translation:`adj. 吓人的；恐怖的`,phonetic:`'skɛri`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a scary moment`,cn:`恐怖的一刻`},{en:`a scary movie`,cn:`恐怖片`},{en:`The book is both scary and funny.`,cn:`这本书既恐怖又有趣。`}]},{word:`kind`,translation:`n. 种类`,phonetic:`kaɪnd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Get me a sandwich – any kind will do.`,cn:`给我一份三明治，随便哪种都可以。`}]},{word:`kind of`,translation:`稍微；有点儿`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`Australia`,translation:`n. 澳大利亚`,phonetic:`ɔ'streljə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He transplanted his family to Australia.`,cn:`他把家迁到澳大利亚。`},{en:`He went out to Australia about five years ago.`,cn:`他大约在五年前移居澳大利亚。`},{en:`In the past, English criminals were transported to Australia.`,cn:`过去，英国犯人被流放到澳大利亚。`}]},{word:`south`,translation:`adj. 南方的; n. 南； 南方`,phonetic:`saʊθ`,partOfSpeech:`adj / n`,examples:[{en:`a village on the south coast`,cn:`南部海岸的一座村庄`},{en:`I am currently teaching in south Texas.`,cn:`我目前在得克萨斯南部教书。`}]},{word:`Africa`,translation:`n. 非洲`,phonetic:`ˈæfrɪkə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The giraffe ranges in Africa.`,cn:`长颈鹿生长在非洲。`},{en:`The practice still prevails in some parts of Africa.`,cn:`这种做法在非洲某些地区仍然很盛行。`},{en:`He traversed alone the whole continent of Africa from east to west.`,cn:`他独自一人从东到西横越整个非洲大陆。`}]},{word:`South  Africa`,translation:`南非`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`pet`,translation:`n. 宠物`,phonetic:`pɛt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They have two pets – a cat and a dog.`,cn:`他们有两只宠物，一只猫和一只狗。`},{en:`We weren’t allowed to keep pets at school.`,cn:`学校里不许我们养宠物。`},{en:`Rabbits make good pets .`,cn:`兔子是很好的宠物。`},{en:`pet food`,cn:`宠物粮食`},{en:`a pet shop`,cn:`宠物商店`}]},{word:`leg`,translation:`n. 腿`,phonetic:`lɛɡ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a young boy with skinny legs`,cn:`双腿干瘦的小男孩`},{en:`She fell and broke her leg.`,cn:`她摔断了腿。`}]},{word:`cat`,translation:`n. 猫`,phonetic:`kæt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The police played an elaborate game of cat and mouse to trap him.`,cn:`警方跟他玩了一场精心布局的猫捉老鼠游戏，诱他落网。`}]},{word:`sleep`,translation:`n. 睡觉`,phonetic:`slip`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I didn’t get much sleep last night.`,cn:`我昨天晚上睡得不多。`},{en:`Her eyes were red through lack of sleep.`,cn:`因为缺少睡眠，她双眼通红。`},{en:`She died peacefully in her sleep.`,cn:`她在睡梦中安然去世。`}]},{word:`friendly`,translation:`adj. 友好的`,phonetic:`ˈfrɛndlɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a friendly smile`,cn:`亲切的微笑`},{en:`I’ve found a great pub – good beer and a friendly atmosphere.`,cn:`我找到了一家很棒的酒馆——啤酒好，氛围也亲切。`}]},{word:`shy`,translation:`adj. 羞怯的；腼腆的`,phonetic:`ʃaɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`He was a quiet shy man.`,cn:`他是个话不多、害羞的男人。`},{en:`a shy smile`,cn:`羞怯的微笑`},{en:`As a teenager, I was painfully shy (= extremely shy ) .`,cn:`我十几岁时害羞得很。`}]},{word:`save`,translation:`v. 救；救助`,phonetic:`sev`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Emergency aid could save millions threatened with starvation.`,cn:`紧急援助可以拯救数百万受到饥饿威胁的人。`},{en:`a new treatment that could save his life`,cn:`能够挽救他生命的一种新疗法`},{en:`She was determined to save her marriage.`,cn:`她决心挽救自己的婚姻。`},{en:`the campaign to save the rainforests`,cn:`拯救热带雨林的运动`}]},{word:`symbol`,translation:`n. 象征`,phonetic:`'sɪmbl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The symbol on the packet is a guarantee that the food has been produced organically.`,cn:`包装盒上的这个标识保证这种食物是有机生产的。`}]},{word:`flag`,translation:`n. 旗；旗帜`,phonetic:`flæg`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Children waving flags greeted the Russian leader.`,cn:`孩子们挥舞着旗帜，欢迎俄罗斯领导人。`},{en:`the flag of Kenya`,cn:`肯尼亚国旗`},{en:`the Spanish flag`,cn:`西班牙国旗`}]},{word:`forget`,translation:`v. 忘记；遗忘`,phonetic:`fɚ'ɡɛt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I’m sorry, I’ve forgotten your name.`,cn:`对不起，我忘记你的名字了。`},{en:`I know you told me, but I forgot.`,cn:`我知道你告诉过我，但是我忘了。`},{en:`What happened that day will never be forgotten.`,cn:`那一天的事永远难忘。`},{en:`He’s someone who never forgets a face (= forgets who someone is ) .`,cn:`他是那种见人一面就不会忘记的人。`}]},{word:`get lost`,translation:`迷路`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`A: Yeah.But it’s easy to get lost in the forest and compass is useless there.`,cn:`是的。 但那里的森林很容易迷路，而且指南针在那儿派不上用场。`},{en:`Of course, most men have no interest in being there and that is why they get lost in the aisles.`,cn:`当然了，大多数男人还是对在超市不感兴趣的，这也是为什么他们在过道都会迷路的原因。`},{en:`It might seem impossible to get lost in the modern world with its ubiquity of digital maps, but there is more than one way to be lost.`,cn:`在这个到处都有电子地图的现代世界，迷路恐怕不太可能发生了，但我们还是有不只一种会导致迷失的方法。`}]},{word:`place`,translation:`n. 地点；位置`,phonetic:`ples`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Make sure you keep the key in a safe place.`,cn:`一定要把钥匙放在安全的地方。`},{en:`I’ve spent the day dashing about from place to place.`,cn:`我这一天尽是在东奔西跑。`},{en:`The place was full of screaming children.`,cn:`那地方全是大叫大嚷的孩子们。`},{en:`He was threatening to burn the place down.`,cn:`他扬言要把那地方烧毁。`},{en:`She had never been back to the place where the accident happened.`,cn:`她再也没回过事故发生的地点。`},{en:`The theatre bar was our usual meeting place.`,cn:`这个剧院酒吧是我们见面的老地方。`},{en:`We were living then in a place called Alberiga.`,cn:`那时候我们住在一个叫阿尔伯里格的地方。`},{en:`The wall was quite damp in places (= in some places ) .`,cn:`墙上有几处很潮湿。`},{en:`Did the accident happen at your place of work (= the place where you work ) ?`,cn:`事故是在你的工作地点发生的吗？`},{en:`The Great Mosque has been a place of worship for Muslims for centuries.`,cn:`很多世纪以来大清真寺是穆斯林朝拜的地方。`}]},{word:`water`,translation:`n. 水`,phonetic:`ˈwɔtɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There’s water all over the bathroom floor.`,cn:`浴室地面上都是水。`},{en:`Does anyone want a drink of water?`,cn:`有谁想喝杯水吗？`},{en:`a glass of sparkling mineral water`,cn:`一杯有气矿泉水`},{en:`All rooms have hot and cold running water.`,cn:`所有房间都有冷热自来水供应。`},{en:`Pour boiling water over the rice and let it soak.`,cn:`在大米中倒入沸水浸泡。`},{en:`a fresh water spring`,cn:`淡水泉`},{en:`When dealing with a burst pipe, always turn off the water first.`,cn:`处理破裂水管时，一定要先把水关掉。`},{en:`contamination of the local water supply`,cn:`当地供水受到污染`}]},{word:`danger`,translation:`n. 危险`,phonetic:`'dendʒɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Danger! No boats beyond this point.`,cn:`危险！船只不可越过此处。`},{en:`The refugees believe that their lives are in danger .`,cn:`难民认为他们有生命危险。`}]},{word:`be in (great) danger`,translation:`处于（极大）危险之中`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`cut`,translation:`v. 砍；切`,phonetic:`kʌt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Do you want me to cut the cake?`,cn:`要我切蛋糕吗？`},{en:`The telephone wires had been cut minutes before the assault.`,cn:`袭击前几分钟，电话线已经被切断。`}]},{word:`down`,translation:`adv. （坐、躺、倒）下；向下；沿着，顺着`,phonetic:`daʊn`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`David bent down to tie his shoelace.`,cn:`戴维弯腰系鞋带。`},{en:`Get down off the table.`,cn:`从桌子上下来。`},{en:`Tears were streaming down my face.`,cn:`我泪流满面。`},{en:`The sun was going down and it would soon be dark.`,cn:`夕阳西下，天很快就要黑了。`},{en:`They came running down the stairs.`,cn:`他们跑下楼来。`},{en:`She stood on a balcony looking down into the courtyard.`,cn:`她站在阳台上朝下面的院子望去。`},{en:`Glancing down the list of runners, I noticed a familiar name.`,cn:`我往下扫了一眼赛跑选手的名单，注意到了一个熟悉的名字。`},{en:`Her hair came down to her waist.`,cn:`她的头发一直垂到腰际。`},{en:`Ken fell asleep face down (= with his face towards the ground ) on the couch.`,cn:`肯趴在长沙发上睡着了。`},{en:`A young man came hurrying down the street.`,cn:`. 一个年轻人急匆匆地沿着街道走来。`}]},{word:`cut down`,translation:`砍倒`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`A vandal with a chainsaw cut down a tree.`,cn:`一个蓄意破坏公物者用链锯锯倒了一棵树。`}]},{word:`tree`,translation:`n. 树`,phonetic:`tri`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`As a kid, I loved to climb trees.`,cn:`小时候，我喜欢爬树。`},{en:`the trunk of an old oak tree (= the main central part, from which the branches grow )`,cn:`一棵老橡树的树干`}]},{word:`kill`,translation:`v. 杀死；弄死`,phonetic:`kɪl`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Why did she kill her husband?`,cn:`她为什么杀死丈夫？`},{en:`Murray held a gun to his head and threatened to kill him.`,cn:`默里拿枪指着他的头并威胁要杀了他。`},{en:`Four people were killed when a train plunged into a flooded river.`,cn:`火车冲进洪水泛滥的河中，造成四人身亡。`},{en:`Bleach kills household germs.`,cn:`漂白剂能够杀灭日常病菌。`},{en:`Smoking kills.`,cn:`吸烟会致人死亡。`}]},{word:`ivory`,translation:`n. 象牙`,phonetic:`'aɪvəri`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`an ivory chess set`,cn:`一副象牙国际象棋`}]},{word:`over`,translation:`prep. 超过；多于；；在… 上方（但未碰触）`,phonetic:`'ovɚ`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`The Japanese were producing over 100 million tons of steel.`,cn:`日本的钢产量超过了1亿吨。`},{en:`toys suitable for children over the age of three`,cn:`适合3岁以上儿童的玩具`},{en:`drivers who go over the speed limit`,cn:`超速驾驶的司机`},{en:`A lamp hung over the table.`,cn:`一盏灯悬挂在桌子上方。`}]},{word:`(be) made of`,translation:`由……制成的`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`Julie`,translation:`朱莉（女名）`,phonetic:`'dʒu:li`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Julie, do you know why we celebrate Easter?`,cn:`朱莉，你知道我们为什么庆祝复活节吗？`},{en:`Julie: And then what do you do with that log?`,cn:`朱莉：然后你要拿那些记录做什么呢？`},{en:`The St. Lawrence River held a particular poetry and beauty to me and (I) decided to live there with our daughter, Julie.`,cn:`圣劳伦斯河对我来说有着特殊的诗意和美感，(我) 决定和我的女儿朱莉一起生活在那里。`}]},{word:`Becky`,translation:`贝姬（女名）`,phonetic:`'beki`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`So John and Becky and their two little girls go on with their semi-rural life in Alaska.`,cn:`约翰和贝基以及他们的两个小女儿继续着在阿拉斯加的半乡村式的生活。`},{en:`John and Becky were then in their late twenties and had no need of our permission, but we encouraged them to give it a try.`,cn:`当时约翰和贝基已经是二十八九，做这个决定并没有必要得到我们的批准，但我们还是鼓励他们去试试。`}]},{word:`Thailand`,translation:`n. 泰国`,phonetic:`'taɪlænd; -lənd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`In Thailand?`,cn:`在泰国吗？`},{en:`I was born in Thailand.`,cn:`我可是在泰国出生的。`}]},{word:`Thai`,translation:`n. 泰国（人的）；泰语（的)`,phonetic:`taɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She was interviewed about the death of the Thai worker on Israeli TV and she plans to continue to work for peace.`,cn:`她接受了以色列电视台关于这位泰国工人致死的报道，并且她计划继续致力于为和平而工作。`},{en:`So the next time you and your brother go out for Thai food you can make him look like a total wimp (I hate my brother).`,cn:`所以改天你和你的兄弟去吃泰国菜，你就可以让他像个胆小鬼眼巴巴地看着你（我讨厌我的兄弟）。`}]},{word:`newspaper`,translation:`n. 报纸`,phonetic:`'nuzpepɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She had read about it in the newspapers.`,cn:`关于这件事她已经在报纸上看到了。`},{en:`a series of newspaper articles about life in Cuba`,cn:`刊登在报纸上的一系列关于古巴生活的文章`}]},{word:`read a newspaper`,translation:`看报纸`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`And though I could read a newspaper when I was four, scores were only pretty black squiggles.`,cn:`我在四岁时就能看报纸，但乐谱对我来说，只是一片黑不溜秋的花体字。`},{en:`Acuteness of sight is difficult to define but if we were endowed with the eyesight of a kestrel it is estimated that we could read a newspaper at a range of 25 yards.`,cn:`食肉鸟视力的敏锐度是很维定义的，但是我们可以这样给鹰的视力加以说明，如果我们具有鹰的视力，那么我们可以在25码的距离之外可以看报纸。`},{en:`“I couldn't even read a newspaper because the letters on the page looked like alphabet soup, ” she recalled during a recent interview in her home in Arlington, Va.`,cn:`在最近的一次在她的家乡（弗吉尼亚州阿林顿）对她的采访中她说：“那段时间，我几乎连报纸都不能读，因为那些报纸上的字母看起来就像字母汤。”`}]},{word:`use`,translation:`v. 使用；运用`,phonetic:`juz`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Can I use your phone?`,cn:`我可以用一下你的电话吗？`},{en:`I’ll show you which room you can use.`,cn:`我来跟你说一下你可以用哪个房间。`},{en:`I always use the same shampoo.`,cn:`我一直用同一种洗发水。`},{en:`Use your imagination when planning meals.`,cn:`安排三餐时要动点脑筋。`},{en:`She booked the flight using a false name.`,cn:`她用化名预订了航班。`}]},{word:`Soup`,translation:`n. 汤`,phonetic:`sup`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`...home-made chicken soup.`,cn:`…自家做的鸡汤。`}]},{word:`make soup`,translation:`做汤`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`"You have given us the greatest of gifts: the secret of how to make soup from stones", said an elder, "and we shall never forget."`,cn:`“你们把最好的礼物送给了我们：如何从石头里做汤的秘密”，一位长老说道，“这一点我们永远也不会忘记。”`},{en:`Once the instruments are worn out, the musicians, and a conductor who doubles as cook, toss each onesintosa stewpot to make soup -- to be enjoyed by the audience after the concert.`,cn:`这些乐器若是用坏了,乐手们和指挥(他还兼厨师)就把它们扔到锅里做汤,在音乐会之后让观众们享用。`}]},{word:`wash`,translation:`v. 洗`,phonetic:`wɔʃ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`This shirt needs washing.`,cn:`这件衬衫该洗洗了。`},{en:`It’s your turn to wash the dishes.`,cn:`该轮到你洗碗碟了。`}]},{word:`movie`,translation:`n. 电影`,phonetic:`'muvi`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It was like one of those old John Wayne movies.`,cn:`这部电影有点像约翰•韦恩演的一部老片子。`}]},{word:`go to movies`,translation:`看电影`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I plan to go to movies tonight.`,cn:`我打算今晚去看电影。`},{en:`I hope to go to movies tonight.`,cn:`我希望今晚去看电影。`},{en:`At night we’d go to movies or local restaurants or just stay in and talk.`,cn:`晚上，我们一起去看电影，或是到当地的餐馆里去美餐一顿，要么就待在家里聊天。`}]},{word:`just`,translation:`adv. 只是；恰好`,phonetic:`dʒʌst`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`A good strong cup of coffee is just what I need right now.`,cn:`我现在正需要喝一杯浓浓的咖啡。`},{en:`The house was large and roomy; just right for us.`,cn:`那幢房子大而宽敞，正合我们的需要。`},{en:`She looks just like her mother.`,cn:`她看上去就像她妈妈。`},{en:`Just what do you think you’re trying to do?`,cn:`你究竟想干什么？`},{en:`A nice hot bath – just the thing(= exactly the right thing ) to relax sore muscles.`,cn:`洗个舒服的热水澡，那正是缓解肌肉酸痛的好方法。`}]},{word:`eat out`,translation:`出去吃饭`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`"Alli, like Xenical, will be useful for people who eat out often and don't have much control over the amount of fat they are served, " says Cederquist.`,cn:`塞德奎斯特说：“艾里和赛克宁一样，对那些常常在外面吃饭的人有用，因为他们对食物中的脂肪量没法控制。`},{en:`If you eat out you will pay triple the price.`,cn:`如果出去吃，你将花三倍的价钱。`}]},{word:`house`,translation:`n. 房子`,phonetic:`haʊs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a four-bedroom house`,cn:`一幢有四间卧室的房子`},{en:`Why don’t you all come over to our house for coffee?`,cn:`你们全都上我们家来喝咖啡如何？`}]},{word:`drink`,translation:`n. 一杯（份）饮料；饮，喝; v. 喝；饮`,phonetic:`drɪŋk`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`He took a drink of his coffee.`,cn:`他喝了一口咖啡。`}]},{word:`tea`,translation:`n. 茶；茶叶`,phonetic:`ti`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`...a box of tea.`,cn:`…一盒茶叶。`}]},{word:`drink  tea`,translation:`喝茶`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`tomorrow`,translation:`adv. 在明天; n. 明天；来日；未来 (尤指不久的将来)`,phonetic:`tə'mɔro`,partOfSpeech:`adv / n`,examples:[{en:`Our class is going to London tomorrow.`,cn:`我们班明天要去伦敦。`}]},{word:`pool`,translation:`n. 游泳池； 水池`,phonetic:`pul`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They have a nice pool in their backyard.`,cn:`他们后院有个漂亮的游泳池。`},{en:`a shallow pool suitable for children`,cn:`适合儿童的浅水池`}]},{word:`shop`,translation:`v. 购物; n. 商店`,phonetic:`ʃɑp`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`The next day, Saturday, we went shopping.`,cn:`第二天是星期六，我们去逛商店了。`},{en:`Mum’s out shopping with Granny.`,cn:`妈妈和奶奶去购物了。`}]},{word:`supermarket`,translation:`n. 超市`,phonetic:`'sʊpɚ'mɑrkɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Most of us do our food shopping in the supermarket.`,cn:`我们大多数人在这家超市采购食品。`}]},{word:`man`,translation:`n. 男人；成年男子；人 (尤用于正式场合或过去)`,phonetic:`mæn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There were two men and a woman in the car.`,cn:`车上有两男一女。`},{en:`He’s a very kind man.`,cn:`他是个非常和蔼的人。`},{en:`a man’s watch`,cn:`男式手表`},{en:`Don’t keep Hansen waiting – he’s a busy man.`,cn:`别让汉森老等着——他可是个大忙人。`}]},{word:`race`,translation:`n. 竞赛`,phonetic:`res`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The women's race was won by the only American in the field, Patti Sue Plumer.`,cn:`女子赛跑被田赛场上惟一的一名美国人帕蒂·休·普卢默赢得了。`}]},{word:`host`,translation:`n. 主人；东道主`,phonetic:`host`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Our host greeted us at the door.`,cn:`主人在门口迎接我们。`}]},{word:`study`,translation:`n. 研究 (对某一课题或问题的)；学习 (尤指在家里或放学后的); v. 学习，攻读`,phonetic:`'stʌdi`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`Recent studies show that women still get paid a lot less than men.`,cn:`最近的调查表明，女性的薪水仍比男性的要低很多。`},{en:`The study was carried out between January and May 2008.`,cn:`这项研究是在 2008 年1月到5月间进行的。`},{en:`Set aside a period of time specifically for study.`,cn:`留出一段时间专门用于学习`},{en:`I’ve been studying English for six years`,cn:`我学英语已有六年了。`}]},{word:`state`,translation:`n. 洲`,phonetic:`stet`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`the United States`,translation:`n. 美国；美利坚合众国`,phonetic:`ði juˈnaɪtɪd stets`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`American`,translation:`adj. 美国的;美洲的; n. 美国人;美洲人`,phonetic:`əˈmɛrɪkən`,partOfSpeech:`adj / n`,examples:[{en:`a famous American writer`,cn:`一位著名的美国作家`},{en:`Her mother is American.`,cn:`她妈妈是美国人。`}]},{word:`dragon`,translation:`n. 龙`,phonetic:`'dræɡən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She worked a dragon on the new linen cloth.`,cn:`她在新的亚麻布上绣了条龙。`}]},{word:`Dragon Boat Festival`,translation:`端午节`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Why do people do that around the time of Dragon Boat Festival?`,cn:`为什么人们在端午节期间都会这么做？`},{en:`Juliet:You have branches on your door, too! Why do people do that around the time of Dragon Boat Festival?`,cn:`朱丽叶：你的门上也插有艾草的枝条！为什麽人们在端午节期间都会这麽做？`}]},{word:`any`,translation:`adj. 任何的； 任一的; pron. 任何；任一`,phonetic:`'ɛni`,partOfSpeech:`adj / pron`,examples:[{en:`We could not reason out which way the robbers escaped, because we were unable to find any trace of them.`,cn:`我们推断不出这些强盗是从哪个方向逃走的，因为我们找不到他们的任何踪迹。`}]},{word:`other`,translation:`adj. 另外的；其他的; pron. 另外的人（或物）`,phonetic:`'ʌðɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adj / pron`,examples:[{en:`They were just like any other young couple.`,cn:`他们那时就和其他任何年轻夫妇一样。`}]},{word:`young`,translation:`adj. 幼小的,年轻的`,phonetic:`jʌŋ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a young child`,cn:`幼儿`},{en:`He’s younger than me.`,cn:`他比我小。`},{en:`You’re too young to get married.`,cn:`你还太小，不能结婚。`},{en:`young trees`,cn:`小树`},{en:`When I was young, I wanted to be a model.`,cn:`我年轻时候想当模特。`},{en:`John was a great footballer in his younger days(= when he was younger ).`,cn:`约翰年轻时是个很棒的足球运动员。`}]},{word:`children`,translation:`n. 儿童`,phonetic:`'tʃɪldrən`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`miss`,translation:`v. 怀念, 思念`,phonetic:`mɪs`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She missed her family badly.`,cn:`她非常想念她的家人。`},{en:`Will you miss me?`,cn:`你会想我吗？`},{en:`John will be sorely missed by his family and friends.`,cn:`约翰会让他的家人和朋友非常想念。`}]},{word:`wish`,translation:`v. 希望`,phonetic:`wɪʃ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I wish that I could afford a new car.`,cn:`我要是有钱买辆新车就好了。`},{en:`He wished Emily were with him.`,cn:`他真希望埃米莉陪着他。`},{en:`Sometimes I wish I had never been born.`,cn:`有时候我倒希望自己没有生出来。`}]},{word:`delicious`,translation:`adj. 可口的,美味的`,phonetic:`dɪ'lɪʃəs`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`‘The meal was absolutely delicious,’ she said politely.`,cn:`“这顿饭味道好极了。” 她礼貌地说道。`},{en:`the delicious smell of new-mown grass`,cn:`新修剪的草坪的芳香`}]},{word:`still`,translation:`adv. 还,仍然`,phonetic:`stɪl`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`I still haven’t finished painting the spare room.`,cn:`我还没粉刷完那间空房间。`},{en:`Do you still have Julie’s phone number?`,cn:`你还留着朱莉的电话号码吗？`}]},{word:`living room`,translation:`n. 客厅`,phonetic:`'lɪvɪŋ rum`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`rain`,translation:`v. 下雨; n. 雨水`,phonetic:`ren`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`Outside it was still raining.`,cn:`外面仍在下雨。`},{en:`It’s starting to rain.`,cn:`开始下雨了。`}]},{word:`windy`,translation:`adj. 多风的`,phonetic:`'wɪndi`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`It’s too windy for a picnic.`,cn:`风太大，不适合野餐。`},{en:`a cold, windy day`,cn:`一个寒冷的大风天`},{en:`a windy hillside`,cn:`当风的山坡`}]},{word:`cloudy`,translation:`adj. 多云的`,phonetic:`'klaʊdi`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a cloudy night with some light rain`,cn:`伴有些许小雨的多云的夜晚`},{en:`Tomorrow, it will be cloudy and cool.`,cn:`明天多云，天气凉爽。`}]},{word:`sunny`,translation:`adj. 晴朗的；开朗的，快乐的`,phonetic:`'sʌni`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`英语例句:a warm sunny day`,cn:`温暖晴朗的一天`},{en:`a sunny smile`,cn:`灿烂的微笑`}]},{word:`snow`,translation:`v. 下雪；; n. 雪`,phonetic:`sno`,partOfSpeech:`v / n`,examples:[{en:`英文例句:Snow was falling heavily as we entered the village.`,cn:`中文例句: 我们进村的时候雪下得正大。`},{en:`It snowed all night.`,cn:`下了一整夜雪。`},{en:`It started snowing around five.`,cn:`5 点钟左右天下起了雪。`}]},{word:`weather`,translation:`n. 天气`,phonetic:`'wɛðɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`What’s the weather like today?`,cn:`今天天气如何？`},{en:`The weather turned bitterly cold.`,cn:`天气变得很冷了。`}]},{word:`cook`,translation:`v. 做饭`,phonetic:`kʊk`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The Government was cooking the books and misleading the public.`,cn:`政府在篡改数据误导公众。`}]},{word:`bad`,translation:`adj. 坏的；糟的`,phonetic:`bæd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I have some bad news for you.`,cn:`我有坏消息要告诉你。`},{en:`I thought things couldn’t possibly get any worse.`,cn:`我想事情最坏也不过如此了。`},{en:`The plane was delayed for several hours by bad weather.`,cn:`天气不好，飞机延误了好几个小时。`},{en:`It’s difficult to break bad habits.`,cn:`坏习惯很难改。`},{en:`a bad smell`,cn:`难闻的气味`}]},{word:`park`,translation:`n. 公园`,phonetic:`pɑrk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Let’s go for a walk in the park.`,cn:`我们去公园散步吧。`},{en:`a park bench`,cn:`公园长椅`},{en:`a flat overlooking Hyde Park`,cn:`一套可以俯瞰海德公园的公寓`}]},{word:`message`,translation:`n. 信息；消息`,phonetic:`'mɛsɪdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He left a message saying he would probably be a little late.`,cn:`他留言说可能会晚一点来。`}]},{word:`take a message`,translation:`捎个口信；传话`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`him`,translation:`pron. 他（he的宾格）`,phonetic:`hɪm`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`Are you in love with him?`,cn:`你爱上他了吗？`},{en:`Why don’t you ask him yourself?`,cn:`你为什么不自己问他？`},{en:`He repeated what she had told him.`,cn:`他把她告诉他的话重复了一遍。`},{en:`I knew it was him as soon as I heard his voice.`,cn:`我一听声音就知道是他。`}]},{word:`could`,translation:`v. 能；可以`,phonetic:`kəd; kʊd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`By the time she was eight, she could read Greek and Latin.`,cn:`她八岁时就会读希腊文和拉丁文了。`},{en:`In those days you could buy a box of cigars for a dollar.`,cn:`那时候，一美元能买一盒雪茄烟。`},{en:`Could you hear what I was saying?`,cn:`你能听到我说的话吗？`},{en:`I couldn’t get tickets after all, they were sold out.`,cn:`我最终还是没能弄到票，全都卖完了。`},{en:`I knew I couldn’t afford the rent.`,cn:`我知道我付不起租金。`},{en:`The teacher said we could all go home.`,cn:`老师说我们都可以回家了。`}]},{word:`back`,translation:`adj. 回来；回原处`,phonetic:`bæk`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`英文例句: I’ll be back in a minute.`,cn:`中文例句:我马上回来。`}]},{word:`call(sb)back`,translation:`回电话`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`problem`,translation:`n. 困难；难题`,phonetic:`'prɑbləm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She was older than me, but that wasn’t really a problem.`,cn:`她比我年长，不过那不算什么问题。`}]},{word:`again`,translation:`adj. 再一次；又一次`,phonetic:`əˈɡɛn, əˈɡen`,partOfSpeech:`adj`},{word:`dry`,translation:`adj. 干燥的`,phonetic:`draɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I need to change into some dry clothes .`,cn:`我要换上干衣服。`},{en:`Make sure that the surface is clean and dry before you start to paint.`,cn:`油漆之前一定先要确保表面清洁干燥。`},{en:`You should store disks in a cool, dry place.`,cn:`你应该把磁盘存放在阴凉干燥的地方。`},{en:`The path is dry as a bone (= very dry ) .`,cn:`这条小道很干燥。`}]},{word:`cold`,translation:`adj. 寒冷的；冷的`,phonetic:`kold`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`She splashed her face with cold water.`,cn:`她往脸上泼冷水。`},{en:`a blast of cold air`,cn:`一股冷空气`},{en:`We slept on the cold ground.`,cn:`我们睡在冰冷的地上。`},{en:`The house felt cold and empty.`,cn:`屋子里感觉很冷，空荡荡的。`}]},{word:`hot`,translation:`adj. 热的；辛辣的`,phonetic:`hɑt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a hot day in July`,cn:`7月炎热的一天`},{en:`a hot curry`,cn:`一种辛辣的咖喱`}]},{word:`warm`,translation:`adj. 温暖的`,phonetic:`wɔrm`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The house was lovely and warm.`,cn:`那房子漂亮温暖。`},{en:`I hope we get some warm weather soon.`,cn:`我希望天气很快就会回暖。`},{en:`I’ve put your dinner in the oven to keep it warm.`,cn:`我把你的饭菜放进了烤箱里保温。`},{en:`warm water`,cn:`温水`}]},{word:`visit`,translation:`v. 拜访；参观`,phonetic:`'vɪzɪt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Eric went to Seattle to visit his cousins.`,cn:`埃里克到西雅图去看望他的表兄弟。`},{en:`I was really pleased that they came to visit me.`,cn:`他们来看我，我真是高兴。`},{en:`Which cities did you visit in Spain?`,cn:`你在西班牙去了哪些城市？`},{en:`A recent trip to London gave me the opportunity to visit the Science Museum.`,cn:`最近的一次伦敦之行让我有机会参观了科学博物馆。`},{en:`She doesn’t visit very often.`,cn:`她不常来。`}]},{word:`Canada`,translation:`n. 加拿大`,phonetic:`'kænədə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She was domiciliated in Canada.`,cn:`她在加拿大定居。`},{en:`Canada produces wheat and furs.`,cn:`加拿大出产小麦和毛皮。`},{en:`He has lived in Canada for more than twenty years and is completely Canadianized now.`,cn:`他在加拿大已经住了二十多年了，现在完全加拿大化了。`}]},{word:`summer`,translation:`n. 夏天；夏季`,phonetic:`'sʌmɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the long hot summer of 1976`,cn:`1976 年炎热漫长的夏天`},{en:`The children play on the beach during the summer.`,cn:`夏天孩子们在海滩上玩耍。`},{en:`a hot summer’s day`,cn:`一个炎热的夏日`},{en:`a sunny summer afternoon`,cn:`一个晴朗的夏日午后`},{en:`a three-week summer vacation`,cn:`为时三周的暑假`},{en:`Parts of Spain are extremely hot in high summer (= the hottest part of summer ) .`,cn:`盛夏时节，西班牙的部分地区极其炎热。`}]},{word:`sit`,translation:`v. 坐`,phonetic:`sɪt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The parliament building sits in a large square.`,cn:`议会大楼位于一个大广场上。`},{en:`He’s got a computer sitting on his desk, but he doesn’t use it.`,cn:`他有一台电脑放在书桌上，但他不用。`},{en:`My climbing boots were sitting unused in a cupboard.`,cn:`我的登山靴在橱柜里，一直没有穿。`},{en:`The house has sat empty for two years.`,cn:`这幢房子已经空置两年了。`}]},{word:`juice`,translation:`n. 果汁；饮料`,phonetic:`dʒus`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a carton of orange juice`,cn:`一纸盒橙汁`},{en:`A Coke and a tomato juice, please.`,cn:`请来一杯可乐和一杯番茄汁。`}]},{word:`soon`,translation:`adv. 不久；很快`,phonetic:`sun`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`It will be dark soon.`,cn:`天很快就要黑了。`},{en:`David arrived sooner than I expected.`,cn:`戴维到得比我预料的快。`},{en:`‘Who?’ ‘You’ll find out soon enough (= fairly soon ) .’`,cn:`“谁？”“你很快就会知道的。”`}]},{word:`vacation`,translation:`n. 假期`,phonetic:`veˈkeʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We’re planning a vacation in Europe.`,cn:`我们正计划去欧洲度假。`},{en:`We’re planning to go on vacation soon.`,cn:`我们在计划近期去度假。`}]},{word:`on(a)vacation`,translation:`度假`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`hard`,translation:`adv. 努力地; adj. 困难的`,phonetic:`hɑrd`,partOfSpeech:`adv / adj`,examples:[{en:`I'll work hard. I don't want to let him down.`,cn:`我会努力工作。我不想让他失望。`},{en:`This year’s exam was much harder than last year’s.`,cn:`今年的考试比去年的难得多。`}]},{word:`Europe`,translation:`n. 欧洲`,phonetic:`'jʊrəp`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`eastern Europe`,cn:`东欧`}]},{word:`mountain`,translation:`n. 高山`,phonetic:`ˈmaʊntn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the highest mountain in Austria`,cn:`奥地利最高的山`},{en:`the Rocky Mountains`,cn:`落基山脉`},{en:`a steep mountain road`,cn:`陡峭的山路`},{en:`magnificent mountain ranges`,cn:`雄伟的山脉`},{en:`snow-capped mountain peaks`,cn:`白雪覆盖的山峰`},{en:`a mountain rescue team`,cn:`山地营救队`},{en:`She was the first British woman to climb the mountain .`,cn:`她是攀登这座山峰的第一位英国女子。`}]},{word:`country`,translation:`n. 国；国家`,phonetic:`'kʌntri`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the Scandinavian countries`,cn:`斯堪的纳维亚国家`},{en:`developing countries`,cn:`发展中国家`},{en:`travelling to a foreign country`,cn:`到国外旅行`}]},{word:`skate`,translation:`v. 滑冰`,phonetic:`sket`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The children skated on the frozen pond.`,cn:`孩子们在结冰的池塘上滑冰。`}]},{word:`snowy`,translation:`adj. 下雪的`,phonetic:`'snoɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`the snowy fields`,cn:`被雪覆盖的田野`},{en:`one snowy January day`,cn:`1月里大雪纷飞的一天`}]},{word:`winter`,translation:`n. 冬天；冬季`,phonetic:`'wɪntɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Soon it will be winter.`,cn:`很快要到冬天了。`}]},{word:`Russian`,translation:`adj. 俄罗斯的；俄罗斯人的；俄语的`,phonetic:`'rʌʃən`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`...the Russian parliament.`,cn:`...俄罗斯国会。`}]},{word:`snowman`,translation:`n. 雪人`,phonetic:`'snomæn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The children were balling up snow to make a snowman.`,cn:`孩子们正在把雪堆成球状，做一个雪人。`},{en:`"He gave me a hug and a kiss and asked me where my snowman was," she said.`,cn:`黛比说：“他给了我一个拥抱和亲吻。 还问我的雪人在哪里。”`},{en:`If you are wrong,the snowman with the correct answer will chill your heart.`,cn:`如果你是错误的，有正确答案的雪人将会使你的心脏变冷。`}]},{word:`rainy`,translation:`adj. 阴雨的；多雨的`,phonetic:`'reni`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a cold rainy day in October`,cn:`十月里一个寒冷的雨天`},{en:`I hate rainy weather .`,cn:`我讨厌雨天。`},{en:`the rainy season`,cn:`雨季`}]},{word:`Moscow`,translation:`莫斯科`,phonetic:`ˈmɑsˌkaʊ`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Must go... to Moscow!`,cn:`一定要去莫斯科！`},{en:`Many of them are coming to Moscow from quite far away for an opportunity to have this kind of educational experience.`,cn:`为了这样一个有教育意义的体验，他们中的很多人都是从很远的地方赶到莫斯科来的。`}]},{word:`Toronto`,translation:`多伦多`,phonetic:`tə'rɑnto`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Julia: What can you do in Toronto?`,cn:`朱莉娅：在多伦多能玩些什么？`},{en:`About 830 people on Facebook have replied they would attend the event in Toronto.`,cn:`大约有830人在脸书上回覆称他们会参与这个多伦多的活动。`},{en:`That’s why our customers come in often, ” the Toronto store manager said.`,cn:`这就是为什么我们的顾客会经常光顾，”多伦多的店面经理说。`}]},{word:`Boston`,translation:`波士顿`,phonetic:`'bɔstən`,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`post`,translation:`n. 邮政`,phonetic:`post`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Was there any post for me today?`,cn:`今天有我的邮件吗？`}]},{word:`office`,translation:`n. 办公室`,phonetic:`'ɔfɪs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The department occupies an office just a mile from the White House.`,cn:`该部门就在离白宫一英里远的地方有个办公楼。`},{en:`Did you go to the office (= the office where you work ) today?`,cn:`今天你去办公室了吗？`},{en:`the increased demand for office space`,cn:`对办公室空间日益增长的需求`}]},{word:`post office`,translation:`n. 邮局`,phonetic:`ˈpost ɔfɪs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The hotel is opposite the post office.`,cn:`邮局的对过是旅馆。`},{en:`Men in the post office classify mail according to places it is to go.`,cn:`邮局里的人员将信件按寄送地点分类。`}]},{word:`police`,translation:`n. 警察`,phonetic:`pə'lis`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Police surrounded the courthouse.`,cn:`警察围在法院大楼四周。`}]},{word:`police station`,translation:`n. 警察局`,phonetic:`pə'lis 'steʃən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He is detained at a police station.`,cn:`他被扣在警察局里。`},{en:`He is detained at a police station.`,cn:`他被押在警察局里。`},{en:`At the police station, everything he said was taken down.`,cn:`在警察局，他说的每句话都被记了下来。`}]},{word:`hotel`,translation:`n. 旅店；酒店`,phonetic:`ho'tɛl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I’ve booked the flights and the hotel.`,cn:`我已订好机票和酒店。`},{en:`We’ll be staying at the Hotel Ibis.`,cn:`我们将住在宜必思酒店。`}]},{word:`restaurant`,translation:`n. 餐馆`,phonetic:`ˈrestərənt; rɛstərənt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He took her out for a five-course dinner in a fancy restaurant.`,cn:`他带她到一家豪华餐厅吃了一顿有五道菜的晚餐。`},{en:`The company runs a chain of restaurants.`,cn:`公司经营连锁饭店。`},{en:`A new restaurant has just opened across the road.`,cn:`马路对面刚开了一家新饭馆。`}]},{word:`bank`,translation:`n. 银行`,phonetic:`bæŋk`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Barclays Bank`,cn:`巴克莱银行`},{en:`a bank loan`,cn:`银行贷款`}]},{word:`hospital`,translation:`n. 医院`,phonetic:`'hɑspɪtl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`They are building a new hospital.`,cn:`他们正在建一家新医院。`}]},{word:`street`,translation:`n. 大街`,phonetic:`strit`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We moved to Center Street when I was young.`,cn:`在我小时候，我们搬到了中心大街。`},{en:`She lives just a few streets away.`,cn:`她的住处就在几条街外。`},{en:`I walked on further down the street .`,cn:`我继续沿着马路走。`},{en:`Someone just moved in across the street .`,cn:`街对面有人刚刚搬进来。`},{en:`a car parked on the other side of the street`,cn:`停在街对面的一辆车`}]},{word:`pay`,translation:`v. 付费`,phonetic:`pe`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`How would you like to pay?`,cn:`你想怎么付款？`}]},{word:`pay phone`,translation:`付费电话`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`The newspapers near the pay phone in Central Perk are six months old.`,cn:`中央咖啡馆里，公用电话旁边的报纸已经摆了半年了。`},{en:`Backpacking through Austria that spring, I used a youth hostel pay phone to call home, only to learn that I’d been rejected from the 27 medical schools where I had applied.`,cn:`那年春天，在我身背背包周游奥地利期间，我用一家青年旅馆的投币电话打电话回家时才知道，我所申请的27所医学院没有一所录取我。`},{en:`I went right to the pay phone, called Hillary, told her the story, and said I thought we could win.`,cn:`我直接朝投币电话亭走去，拨通了希拉里的电话，把这件事告诉了她，并对她说，我觉得这次我们能赢。`}]},{word:`near`,translation:`prep. 在……附近`,phonetic:`nɪr`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`We registered at a three star hotel near the airport.`,cn:`我们在机场附近的一家三星级旅馆登记投宿。`},{en:`Most of our forces have concentrated near the station.`,cn:`我们大部分兵力集结在车站附近。`},{en:`Contractors have started building on waste land near the town.`,cn:`承包商在城附近的荒地上开始从事营造业。`}]},{word:`across`,translation:`adv. 过；穿过`,phonetic:`ə'krɔs`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`the first flight across the Atlantic`,cn:`跨越大西洋的首次飞行`},{en:`They ran straight across the road (=  without stopping  ) .`,cn:`他们径直跑过了马路。`},{en:`We’ll have to swim across.`,cn:`我们得游过去。`},{en:`We’d got halfway across before Philip realized he’d left his money at home.`,cn:`我们走到半路，菲利普才意识到他把钱忘在家里了。`},{en:`We gazed across the valley.`,cn:`我们向山谷另一边凝望。`}]},{word:`across from`,translation:`在……对面`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I looked up at my friend sitting across from me.`,cn:`我抬头看向坐在我对面的朋友。`}]},{word:`front`,translation:`n. 前面`,phonetic:`frʌnt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He wore an old sweater with a coffee stain down the front.`,cn:`他穿着一件旧毛衣，前面有一道咖啡渍。`}]},{word:`in front of`,translation:`在……前面`,phonetic:`ɪn frʌnt ʌv`,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I'll not want to say in front of the reporters.`,cn:`我不愿在记者面前谈论我的观点。`}]},{word:`behind`,translation:`prep. 在……后面`,phonetic:`bɪ'haɪnd`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`I turned to speak to the person standing behind me.`,cn:`我转身和站在我后面的那人说话。`},{en:`Someone could easily creep up behind us.`,cn:`很可能有人跟在我们后面。`},{en:`The car behind was hooting impatiently.`,cn:`后面那辆车不耐烦地按着喇叭。`},{en:`Jane shut the door behind her.`,cn:`简随手关上身后的门。`},{en:`The manager was sitting behind a large desk.`,cn:`经理坐在一张大办公桌的后面。`}]},{word:`town`,translation:`n. 镇；市镇`,phonetic:`taʊn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`an industrial town in the Midlands`,cn:`英格兰中部的一座工业城镇`},{en:`I walked to the nearest town.`,cn:`我走到最近的镇上。`}]},{word:`around`,translation:`adv. 到处；大约`,phonetic:`ə'raʊnd`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`He wandered around the streets, looking in shop windows.`,cn:`他在街上闲逛，看看商店橱窗。`},{en:`There are over 40 radio stations dotted around the country.`,cn:`有40多家广播电台分布在全国各地。`},{en:`When I finished college, I travelled around for a while.`,cn:`大学毕业以后，我到处旅游了一段时间。`},{en:`Since it’s your first day here, would you like me to show you around?`,cn:`你第一天到这儿，要我带你四处转转吗？`},{en:`We started looking around for somewhere to live.`,cn:`我们开始到处找住的地方。`},{en:`There must have been around 40,000 people in the stadium.`,cn:`体育场里肯定有4万人左右`}]},{word:`north`,translation:`n. 北；北方; adj. 北方的`,phonetic:`nɔrθ`,partOfSpeech:`n / adj`,examples:[{en:`Which way is north?`,cn:`哪边是北？`}]},{word:`along`,translation:`prep. 沿着`,phonetic:`ə'lɔŋ`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`We were driving along Follyfoot Road.`,cn:`我们沿着福莱福特路行驶。`},{en:`She glanced anxiously along the line of faces.`,cn:`她焦急地扫视着这一排面孔。`},{en:`He slid his hand along her arm.`,cn:`他的手顺着她的臂膀滑下。`}]},{word:`go along`,translation:`沿着（这条街）走`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`turn`,translation:`v. 转向；转移（思考、处理、观察等的对象）`,phonetic:`tɝn`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Phil turned his gaze towards the older man.`,cn:`菲尔把目光转向那个较年长的男子。`},{en:`Now is the time of year when thoughts turn in the direction of summer holidays.`,cn:`现在又到大家考虑夏季度假的时候了。`},{en:`Next the Senator turned to education.`,cn:`接着参议员谈起了教育。`}]},{word:`right`,translation:`adv. 向右边；; n. 右边；`,phonetic:`raɪt`,partOfSpeech:`adv / n`,examples:[{en:`Turn right at the crossroads.`,cn:`在十字路口向右拐。`},{en:`Our car is just to the right of that white van.`,cn:`我们的车就在那辆白色货车的右侧。`}]},{word:`left`,translation:`adv. 向左边; n. 左边；`,phonetic:`lɛft`,partOfSpeech:`adv / n`,examples:[{en:`Turn left just after the school.`,cn:`过了那所学校马上左转。`},{en:`Take the next road on the left.`,cn:`在下一个路口向左转`}]},{word:`turn right/left`,translation:`向右、左转`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Can you turn right/left at the next corner?`,cn:`能不能在下一个街口右转/左转？`}]},{word:`crossing`,translation:`n. 十字路口`,phonetic:`'krɔsɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Turn left at the first crossing.`,cn:`在第一个十字路口左转。`}]},{word:`neighborhood`,translation:`n. 街区；街坊`,phonetic:`'nebɚ,hʊd`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`spend`,translation:`v. 花（时间、钱等）`,phonetic:`spɛnd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I can’t afford to spend any more money this week.`,cn:`这星期我没有能力花更多的钱了。`},{en:`The repairs cost a lot, but it’s money well spent (= a sensible way of spending money ) .`,cn:`修理费很高，但这是该花的钱。`}]},{word:`spend time`,translation:`花时间`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`So I decided to spend time in this village.`,cn:`所以我决定花时间在这个村子里。`},{en:`At this stage in your life you can spend time on yourself without all the guilt.`,cn:`在你生命的这个时间里，你可以花时间做自己的事而不必有罪恶感。`}]},{word:`climb`,translation:`v. 爬`,phonetic:`klaɪm`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Harry climbed the stairs.`,cn:`哈里爬上楼梯。`},{en:`Boys were climbing trees along the river bank.`,cn:`男孩们在河边爬树。`}]},{word:`road`,translation:`n. 路`,phonetic:`rod`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`65 Maple Road`,cn:`枫树路65号`}]},{word:`often`,translation:`adv. 时常；常常`,phonetic:`ˈɔ:fn; ɔfən`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`She often works at the weekend.`,cn:`她周末经常要上班。`},{en:`If you wash your hair too often, it can get too dry.`,cn:`如果洗头过勤，头发会变得干枯。`},{en:`How often do you see your parents?`,cn:`你隔多久去看你父母？`},{en:`Robin is a difficult child; you’ve said so yourself often enough (= a lot of times ).`,cn:`罗宾是个难管的孩子，你自己也常常这么说。`}]},{word:`air`,translation:`n. 空气`,phonetic:`ɛr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Let’s go outside and get some fresh air.`,cn:`我们出去呼吸些新鲜空气吧。`},{en:`You need to put some air in the tyres.`,cn:`你得给轮胎充气了。`}]},{word:`sunshine`,translation:`n. 阳光`,phonetic:`'sʌnʃaɪn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We had three days of spring sunshine.`,cn:`我们享受了三天的春日阳光。`}]},{word:`free`,translation:`adj. 免费的`,phonetic:`fri`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Admission is free for children under 9.`,cn:`九岁以下儿童免费入场。`},{en:`All students are offered free accommodation.`,cn:`所有学生都免费住宿。`},{en:`Send for our free information pack for more details.`,cn:`欲知详情，请来函索取我们的免费信息包。`},{en:`There’s a special free gift with this month’s magazine.`,cn:`本月杂志附赠特别礼物。`}]},{word:`enjoy`,translation:`v. 享受；喜爱`,phonetic:`ɪn'dʒɔɪ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Sandra enjoys her job in the city.`,cn:`桑德拉很喜欢她在城里的这份工作。`},{en:`I enjoyed every minute of it.`,cn:`我每一分钟都很享受。`}]},{word:`enjoy reading`,translation:`喜欢阅读`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Do you enjoy reading before bedtime?`,cn:`你享受睡前的阅读时光吗？`},{en:`So learn to enjoy reading and read a lot.`,cn:`所以学会享受阅读并且多多地读吧。`},{en:`If you enjoy reading, then by all means do that whenever you want.`,cn:`如果你喜欢阅读，不管什么时候，都要想尽一切办法去读。`}]},{word:`easily`,translation:`adv. 容易地`,phonetic:`'izəli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`They won quite easily.`,cn:`他们赢得相当轻松。`},{en:`We found the house easily enough.`,cn:`我们轻轻松松就找到了房子。`}]},{word:`money`,translation:`n. 钱`,phonetic:`'mʌni`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Don’t spend all your money on the first day of your holiday!`,cn:`别在度假的第一天就把钱都花完了！`},{en:`The repairs will cost quite a lot of money.`,cn:`修理要花一大笔钱。`}]},{word:`curly`,translation:`adj. 卷曲的`,phonetic:`'kɝli`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`long dark curly hair`,cn:`又长又黑的鬈发`}]},{word:`straight`,translation:`adj. 直的`,phonetic:`stret`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a long, straight road`,cn:`一条笔直的长路`},{en:`Try to keep your legs straight.`,cn:`尽量把腿伸直。`},{en:`Always lift with a straight back.`,cn:`提东西的时候，一定要把背挺直。`},{en:`her long, straight black hair`,cn:`她又长又直的黑发`},{en:`They sat down in a straight line .`,cn:`他们坐成一直溜儿。`},{en:`The road was dead straight (= completely straight ) .`,cn:`那条路是笔直的。`}]},{word:`tall`,translation:`adj. 高的`,phonetic:`tɔl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`He was young and tall.`,cn:`他年轻，身材高大。`},{en:`a house surrounded by tall trees`,cn:`大树环绕的房子`},{en:`This bush grows tall very quickly.`,cn:`这种灌木很快就能长高。`}]},{word:`medium`,translation:`adj. 中等的`,phonetic:`'midɪəm`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`What size shirt does he wear – small, medium or large?`,cn:`他穿多大尺码的衬衫——小号、中号还是大号？`},{en:`hair of medium length`,cn:`中等长短的头发`},{en:`Fry the onions over a medium heat until they are golden.`,cn:`用中火把洋葱炸到金黄色。`}]},{word:`height`,translation:`n. 身高；高度`,phonetic:`haɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Sam’s about the same height as his sister now.`,cn:`萨姆现在身高和他姐姐差不多了。`},{en:`State your age, height, and weight.`,cn:`说出你的年龄、身高和体重。`},{en:`buildings of different heights`,cn:`高矮不一的建筑`}]},{word:`of medium height`,translation:`中等身高`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`The young man was of medium height for his age.`,cn:`这个年轻人在同龄人中属中等身高。`},{en:`He was of medium height; his face wasscarred by smallpox; he waddled when he walked; and he continually sucked onhis pipe.`,cn:`他中等身材，脸上有天花留下的疤痕，走起路有点儿摇晃。 他那只烟斗几乎从不离口。`},{en:`They describe Kim Jong-un as a man in his mid-20s, of medium height, overweight and prone to high blood pressure and suffering from diabetes, and with character traits similar to his father’s.`,cn:`他们描述了金正云20几岁时的样子，中等身材，肥胖可能伴随高血压和遭受糖尿病的折磨，性格特征和他父亲类似。`}]},{word:`thin`,translation:`adj. 瘦的`,phonetic:`θɪn`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a thin gold chain`,cn:`一条细细的金链`},{en:`She’s only wearing a thin summer jacket (= a jacket made of light material ) .`,cn:`她只穿了一件薄薄的夏装外套。`},{en:`two thin slices of bread`,cn:`薄薄的两片面包`},{en:`The road was covered with a thin layer of ice.`,cn:`路面上覆盖着一层薄薄的冰。`},{en:`The skin on the eyelids is the thinnest on the body.`,cn:`眼睑上的皮肤是人体最薄的皮肤。`}]},{word:`heavy`,translation:`adj. 重的`,phonetic:`'hɛvi`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The wardrobe was too heavy for me to move on my own.`,cn:`衣橱太重，我一个人移不动。`},{en:`a heavy suitcase`,cn:`沉重的手提箱`},{en:`The males are seven times heavier than the females.`,cn:`雄性的重量是雌性的七倍。`},{en:`How heavy is the parcel (= how much does it weigh? ) ?`,cn:`这个包裹有多重？`}]},{word:`build`,translation:`n. 身材`,phonetic:`bɪld`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a woman of slim build`,cn:`身材苗条的女子`},{en:`You’re a surprisingly strong swimmer for one of such a slight build .`,cn:`你个子这么瘦小，想不到竟是游泳高手。`},{en:`I wanted a more athletic and muscular build .`,cn:`我想拥有更加健壮、结实的体格。`}]},{word:`of medium build`,translation:`中等身材`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`He is of medium build and height.`,cn:`他是中等身材，身高。`},{en:`He has curly hair and is of medium build.`,cn:`他头发卷曲，是中等身材。`},{en:`He's tall and he is of medium build. He has short straight hair.`,cn:`他高高的个子、中等体格，留着短的直发。`}]},{word:`tonight`,translation:`adv. 今夜; n. 今夜`,phonetic:`tə'naɪt`,partOfSpeech:`adv / n`,examples:[{en:`I think I’ll go to bed early tonight.`,cn:`我想今晚我会早点上床睡觉。`},{en:`We’re meeting him at 9 o’clock tonight.`,cn:`我们今晚9点和他见面。`},{en:`I’m really looking forward to tonight.`,cn:`我非常期待今晚的到来。`}]},{word:`little`,translation:`adj. 小的`,phonetic:`'lɪtl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a little house`,cn:`小屋`},{en:`a cake decorated with little flowers`,cn:`点缀着小花的蛋糕`},{en:`She was cutting the meat up into little bits.`,cn:`她把肉切成小丁。`}]},{word:`a little`,translation:`一点，少量`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`With a little care you could have avoided the mishap.`,cn:`你要是小心一点， 本来是可以避免这场不测之祸的。`}]},{word:`cinema`,translation:`n. 电影院`,phonetic:`'sɪnəmə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It’s on at the local cinema.`,cn:`此片正在当地影院上映。`}]},{word:`glasses`,translation:`n. 眼镜`,phonetic:`'glæsɪz`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`...the 140 million Americans who wear glasses or contact lenses.`,cn:`…1.4亿戴眼镜或者隐性眼镜的美国人。`}]},{word:`later`,translation:`adj. 以后`,phonetic:`'letɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The role of marketing is dealt with in a later chapter.`,cn:`市场营销的作用会在后面的章节中述及。`},{en:`The launch was postponed to a later date.`,cn:`发射被延期。`}]},{word:`handsome`,translation:`adj. 英俊的`,phonetic:`'hænsəm`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`an extremely handsome young man`,cn:`一位特别英俊的年轻人`},{en:`Sam was tall, dark, and handsome.`,cn:`萨姆高大黝黑，相貌堂堂。`},{en:`his handsome face`,cn:`他英俊的脸庞`}]},{word:`actor`,translation:`n. 演员`,phonetic:`'æktɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`His father was an actor in the Cantonese Opera Company.`,cn:`他父亲曾是粤剧团的一名演员。`}]},{word:`actress`,translation:`n. 女演员`,phonetic:`'æktrɪs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She's not only a great dramatic actress but she's also very funny.`,cn:`她不仅是一位伟大的女戏剧演员，而且也很幽默。`}]},{word:`person`,translation:`n. 人`,phonetic:`'pɝsn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He was a very nice person, always pleasant and friendly.`,cn:`他是个很好的人，始终彬彬有礼。`},{en:`The only person who really said anything helpful was Jack.`,cn:`只有一个人真正说了些有用的话，就是杰克。`},{en:`I like her as a person , but not as a boss.`,cn:`我喜欢她这个人，但作为老板我就不喜欢了。`},{en:`I still know quite a lot of people in the village.`,cn:`我仍然认识村里的很多人。`},{en:`a group of young people`,cn:`一群年轻人`}]},{word:`nose`,translation:`n. 鼻子`,phonetic:`noz`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Someone punched him on the nose.`,cn:`有人一拳打在他的鼻子上。`}]},{word:`blonde`,translation:`adj. 金黄色的`,phonetic:`blɑnd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`He was blonder than his brother.`,cn:`他的头发比哥哥的还黄。`}]},{word:`mouth`,translation:`n. 嘴`,phonetic:`maʊθ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He lifted his glass to his mouth.`,cn:`他把玻璃杯举到嘴边。`},{en:`Liam was fast asleep with his mouth wide open.`,cn:`利亚姆大张着嘴，睡得很熟。`}]},{word:`round`,translation:`adj. 圆形的`,phonetic:`raʊnd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`a big round table`,cn:`一张大圆桌`},{en:`Jamie’s eyes grew round with delight.`,cn:`杰米高兴得瞪圆了眼睛。`}]},{word:`face`,translation:`n. 脸`,phonetic:`fes`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She had a beautiful face.`,cn:`她面容秀美。`},{en:`Her face was white with fear.`,cn:`她吓得脸煞白。`},{en:`A big smile spread across his face.`,cn:`他的脸上绽开了灿烂笑容。`},{en:`I felt like punching him in the face.`,cn:`我真想给他脸上来一拳。`}]},{word:`eye`,translation:`n. 眼睛`,phonetic:`aɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He’s got beautiful eyes.`,cn:`他有一双漂亮的眼睛。`},{en:`There were tears in her eyes as she listened to the story.`,cn:`她听故事时眼里噙着泪水。`},{en:`Ow! I’ve got something in my eye!`,cn:`哎呀！我眼睛里进了什么东西！`}]},{word:`singer`,translation:`n. 歌手`,phonetic:`'sɪŋɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the lead singer (= main singer ) of Slade`,cn:`施莱德乐队的主唱`},{en:`Tina Turner’s backing singers`,cn:`蒂纳·特纳的伴唱歌手`}]},{word:`artist`,translation:`n. 艺术家`,phonetic:`'ɑrtɪst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`an exhibition of paintings by local artists`,cn:`当地画家的画展`}]},{word:`crime`,translation:`n. 犯罪活动`,phonetic:`kraɪm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We moved here because there was very little crime.`,cn:`我们搬到这里来是因为这里的犯罪率很低。`},{en:`Police officers are being given new powers to help combat crime.`,cn:`警官们被赋予新的权力帮助他们打击犯罪。`},{en:`a police crackdown on car crime`,cn:`警察对汽车犯罪活动的一次严厉打击`},{en:`a town with a relatively low crime rate`,cn:`犯罪率相对较低的一个城镇`}]},{word:`criminal`,translation:`n. 罪犯`,phonetic:`'krɪmɪnl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Police have described the man as a violent and dangerous criminal.`,cn:`警方形容那名男子是个凶暴而危险的罪犯。`},{en:`a convicted criminal`,cn:`一名已决罪犯`},{en:`The new law will ensure that habitual criminals (= criminals who commit crimes repeatedly ) receive tougher punishments than first-time offenders.`,cn:`新法律将确保惯犯比初犯受到更为严厉的惩罚。`},{en:`Teenagers should not be sent to prison to mix with hardened criminals (= criminals who have committed and will continue to commit a lot of crimes ) .`,cn:`青少年不该被送进监狱和惯犯混杂在一起。`}]},{word:`put`,translation:`v. 放`,phonetic:`pʊt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`He put the coffee on the table.`,cn:`他把咖啡放在桌上。`},{en:`Where did you put the programmes?`,cn:`你把节目单放在哪里了？`}]},{word:`each`,translation:`pron. 每个，各自`,phonetic:`itʃ`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`Try to dress appropriately for each occasion.`,cn:`试图为每个场合适当地打扮。`}]},{word:`way`,translation:`n. 方式；路线`,phonetic:`we`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`There are several different ways we can tackle this problem.`,cn:`我们可以用几种不同的方法处理这个问题。`},{en:`There’s no way of knowing if the treatment will work.`,cn:`没有办法知道这种治疗方法是否有效。`},{en:`There are several ways through the woods.`,cn:`有好几条路可以穿过树林。`}]},{word:`describe`,translation:`v. 描述`,phonetic:`dɪ'skraɪb`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The police asked her to describe the man.`,cn:`警察叫她描述一下那名男子。`},{en:`Another approach to the problem is described in Chapter 3.`,cn:`这个问题的另一种解决方法在第三章有所阐述。`}]},{word:`differently`,translation:`adv. 不同地`,phonetic:`'dɪfərəntli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Words written alike are often pronounced differently.`,cn:`拼法相同的词往往读音不同。`},{en:`Different lawyers may construe the same law differently.`,cn:`对同一法律，不同的律师可以做出不同的解释。`},{en:`For me, this uncertainty lies at the heart of what we need to know if we are to understand ourselves and behave differently.`,cn:`对我而言，这样的不确定性就存在于我们需要去了解的内心，即我们懂得我们自己和行为本身是不同的。`}]},{word:`another`,translation:`det & pron. 另一，又一`,phonetic:`ə'nʌðɚ`,partOfSpeech:`det & pron`,examples:[{en:`Can you cite another case like this one?`,cn:`你能举出另一个像这样的例子吗?`},{en:`He transferred his son to another school.`,cn:`他将儿子转学到另一所学校。`},{en:`She buddied up with a student from another university.`,cn:`她与来自另一大学的一名学生交朋友。`}]},{word:`end`,translation:`n. 结尾，尽头`,phonetic:`ɛnd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He wore spectacles perched on the very end of his nose.`,cn:`他的眼镜架在鼻尖上。`},{en:`The end of the pencil snapped.`,cn:`铅笔的笔尖啪的一声断了。`},{en:`Jo joined the end of the line.`,cn:`乔排到了队尾。`},{en:`eg:the far end(= furthest from you ) of the room`,cn:`房间的另一头`},{en:`The channel measures 20 feet from end to end.`,cn:`这条管道全长为20英尺。`}]},{word:`in the end`,translation:`最后`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`There really is no time like the present, and if you miss it…well…we all go away in the end.`,cn:`事实上，没有其他时间像是现在一样，如果你错过了现在……那么……我们最后都会死去。`}]},{word:`real`,translation:`adj. 真正的;真实的`,phonetic:`'riəl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`There is a real danger that the disease might spread.`,cn:`这种疾病确实有蔓延的危险。`},{en:`We need to tackle the real problems of unemployment and poverty.`,cn:`我们需要解决失业和贫穷这两个实际问题。`},{en:`There is no real reason to worry.`,cn:`没有什么真正的理由需要担心。`}]},{word:`jeans`,translation:`n. 牛仔裤`,phonetic:`dʒi:nz`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`...a young man in jeans and a worn T-shirt.`,cn:`…一个穿着牛仔裤和破旧T恤衫的年轻人。`}]},{word:`noodle`,translation:`n. 面条`,phonetic:`'nudl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Serve the meat with rice or noodles.`,cn:`肉配米饭或面条一起上。`}]},{word:`mutton`,translation:`n. 羊肉`,phonetic:`'mʌtn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`...a leg of mutton.`,cn:`…一条羊腿。`}]},{word:`beef`,translation:`n. 牛肉`,phonetic:`bif`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`roast beef`,cn:`烤牛肉`},{en:`We have both dairy and beef cattle on the farm.`,cn:`我们农场里奶牛和菜牛都有。`}]},{word:`cabbage`,translation:`n. 卷心菜；洋白菜`,phonetic:`ˈkæbɪdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I hate eating cabbage.`,cn:`我讨厌吃卷心菜。`},{en:`"I grew up in a place like this, where everyone I knew went to space, " Garriott tells me over a lunch of veal and cabbage at a dreary Star City cafeteria.`,cn:`“我在这样一个地方长大，这里我知道的每一个人都去过外太空，”加略特和我在星城一个沉闷的餐馆吃着牛肉和卷心菜的午餐。`}]},{word:`potato`,translation:`n. 土豆；马铃薯`,phonetic:`pə'teto`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Marie stood at the sink, peeling potatoes (= cutting off the skin ) .`,cn:`玛丽站在洗涤槽边削土豆皮。`}]},{word:`special`,translation:`adj. 特别的；特殊的; n. 特色菜；特价品`,phonetic:`ˈspɛʃəl`,partOfSpeech:`adj / n`,examples:[{en:`a special place in the classroom for reading`,cn:`教室里的阅读专区`},{en:`a TV special on the election`,cn:`有关大选的一档电视特别节目`}]},{word:`would`,translation:`v. （用于礼貌地请求）`,phonetic:`wʊd; wəd`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Would you shut the window, please?`,cn:`请把窗户关上，好吗？`},{en:`Would you mind waiting outside?`,cn:`您在外面等好吗？`},{en:`Would someone please tell me what is going on?`,cn:`请问谁能告诉我发生什么事了？`}]},{word:`would like`,translation:`愿意；喜欢`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I would like to live to , and not to live.`,cn:`我愿意为了而活着，不愿意为了活着而。`},{en:`And then you would like me as well as your father?`,cn:`那你就会喜欢我像喜欢你父亲一样了吗？`}]},{word:`yet`,translation:`adv. （常用于否定句或疑问句）还；仍然`,phonetic:`jɛt`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`I haven’t asked him yet (= but I will ).`,cn:`我还没有问他。`},{en:`Has Edmund arrived yet?`,cn:`埃德蒙到了吗？`},{en:`‘Have you finished your homework?’ ‘Not yet.’`,cn:`“你做完家庭作业了吗？”“还没有。”`}]},{word:`large`,translation:`adj. 大号的；大的`,phonetic:`lɑrdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Los Angeles is the second largest city in the US.`,cn:`洛杉矶是美国的第二大城市。`},{en:`The T-shirt comes in Small, Medium and Large.`,cn:`这种T恤有小号、中号和大号。`},{en:`a large ovenproof pan`,cn:`一只耐热的大烤盘`},{en:`large sums ofmoney`,cn:`大笔的钱`},{en:`those who drink large amounts of coffee`,cn:`咖啡喝得很多的人`},{en:`A large number of students have signed up for the course.`,cn:`很多学生报名读这门课程。`}]},{word:`order`,translation:`n. 命令；点菜，点饮料; n. 发出/颁布命令`,phonetic:`'ɔrdɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The soldier disobeyed an order.`,cn:`这名士兵违抗了命令。`},{en:`He said that the order was outgrown for the situation.`,cn:`他说在那种形势下，该命令已不适用了。`},{en:`The waiter took our orders.`,cn:`服务生给我们点餐。`},{en:`The waiter took our orders.`,cn:`服务生给我们点餐。`},{en:`Williams ordered him to leave.`,cn:`威廉斯命令他离开。`}]},{word:`take one's order`,translation:`点菜`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`size`,translation:`n. 大小；尺码`,phonetic:`saɪz`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`He’s a small boy, about John’s size.`,cn:`他是个小男孩，个子和约翰差不多。`},{en:`Jensens’ house is about the same size as ours.`,cn:`詹森的房子和我们的差不多大。`},{en:`He’s quite a big dog, but he’s still not full size yet.`,cn:`这条狗体型很大，但还没有长足。`}]},{word:`bowl`,translation:`n. 碗`,phonetic:`bol`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Mix all the ingredients thoroughly in a large bowl.`,cn:`将所有配料放在大碗里搅拌均匀。`},{en:`Fill the bowl with water.`,cn:`在碗里装满水。`}]},{word:`one(large)bowl of`,translation:`一（大）碗`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`tofu`,translation:`n. 豆腐`,phonetic:`'tofu`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`But I also use it on baked potatoes, salads, tofu, and dozens of other foods.`,cn:`但是，我也用它来混合烤土豆，沙拉，豆腐，和几十个其他食物。`},{en:`Soy products like tofu, tempeh and fortified soymilk do double duty in this regard since they provide both calcium and protein.`,cn:`大豆食品像豆腐、豆豉和强化豆奶在这方面有双重功能，因为它们可同时提供钙和蛋白。`}]},{word:`meat`,translation:`n. （可食用的）肉`,phonetic:`mit`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I gave up eating meat a few months ago.`,cn:`我几个月以前开始不吃肉了。`},{en:`raw meat`,cn:`生肉`},{en:`a meat pie`,cn:`肉馅饼`},{en:`a selection of cold meats`,cn:`各种冷盘肉`}]},{word:`dumpling`,translation:`n. 饺子`,phonetic:`'dʌmplɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`chicken and dumplings`,cn:`鸡肉和汤团`}]},{word:`porridge`,translation:`n. 粥；面糊`,phonetic:`'pɔrɪdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`onion`,translation:`n. 洋葱`,phonetic:`'ʌnjən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Chop the onions finely.`,cn:`把洋葱切碎。`},{en:`red onions`,cn:`红皮洋葱`},{en:`home-made onion soup`,cn:`自制的洋葱汤`}]},{word:`fish`,translation:`n. 鱼；鱼肉`,phonetic:`fɪʃ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Over 1,500 different species of fish inhabit the waters around the reef.`,cn:`那片礁石周围的水域生活着1,500多种不同的鱼类。`},{en:`The stonefish is the most deadly of all fishes.`,cn:`石鱼是所有鱼类中毒性最强的。`},{en:`You usually drinks white wine with fish.`,cn:`湖中有许多鱼。`}]},{word:`pancake`,translation:`n. 烙饼；薄饼`,phonetic:`'pænkek`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The package says baking and pancake mix, but the pancakes were not tasty without some major tweaking to the recipe.`,cn:`包装盒上说烤焙与薄饼面料混合，但没有添加一些主要调料，薄饼是不好吃的。`}]},{word:`world`,translation:`n. 世界`,phonetic:`wɝld`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Tuberculosis is still common in some parts of the world .`,cn:`结核病在世界上某些地区仍很常见。`},{en:`At that time China was the most powerful country in the world .`,cn:`当时中国是世界上最强大的国家。`},{en:`The Taj Mahal attracts visitors from around the world .`,cn:`泰姬陵吸引了来自世界各地的游客。`},{en:`Students from all over the world come to study at Oxford.`,cn:`世界各地的学生到牛津大学来求学。`},{en:`Children are the same the world over .`,cn:`全世界的孩子都一样。`},{en:`The book has been published throughout the world .`,cn:`这本书已在世界各地出版。`},{en:`There is nothing quite like it anywhere in the world .`,cn:`世界上任何地方都找不出和它类似的东西。`},{en:`Europe’s relationship with the rest of the world`,cn:`欧洲和世界上其他地区的关系`},{en:`I decided to take a year off to travel the world .`,cn:`我决定休息一年去周游世界。`},{en:`a crime that shocked the world`,cn:`震惊全世界的罪行`}]},{word:`around the world`,translation:`世界各地`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`We have people coming from all around the world.`,cn:`我们那里有来自世界各地的人。`},{en:`(Applause.) Together, they represent the great potential and expectations of young people around the world.`,cn:`（掌声）他们共同代表着世界各地年轻人的极大潜力和期望。`},{en:`Thanks to all the fans who make this tournament the best in the world and thanks to my family who travel with me around the world and make it all possible.`,cn:`非常谢谢所有球迷，是你们让这次的比赛变得如此的精彩，感谢我的家人，他们陪伴我在世界各地旅行，使他们让这一切成真。`}]},{word:`answer`,translation:`n. 回答，答复；答案`,phonetic:`'ænsɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`You don’t have to give them an answer now.`,cn:`你不必现在就给他们答复。`},{en:`Every time I ask him about it, I get a different answer.`,cn:`我每次问他此这件事，都得到不同的回答。`},{en:`She’s still waiting for an answer from the school.`,cn:`她还在等校方的答复。`},{en:`The honest answer was that I didn’t know.`,cn:`坦白回答，我不知道。`},{en:`He was never able to get a straight answer about why it happened.`,cn:`事情为什么会发生，他一直没有得到直接的回答。`},{en:`It’s impossible for me to give you a definite answer at this time.`,cn:`现在我无法给你明确答复。`},{en:`The short answer is that it can’t be done.`,cn:`简单的回答就是做不了。`},{en:`In answer to your question , yes, you can go.`,cn:`我来回答你的问题，是的，你可以去。`},{en:`If it’s money you want, the answer is no !`,cn:`如果你要的是钱，回答是不行！`},{en:`What was the answer to question 4?`,cn:`第四题的答案是什么？`}]},{word:`different`,translation:`adj. 不同的`,phonetic:`'dɪfrənt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The place looks completely different now.`,cn:`这地方现在完全变了。`},{en:`They decided to try a radically different approach.`,cn:`他们决定尝试一种全然不同的办法。`},{en:`We found women had significantly different political views from men.`,cn:`我们发现女性的政治观点与男性大不相同。`},{en:`a slightly different way of doing things`,cn:`稍有区别的做事方法`},{en:`What actually happened was subtly different from the PR people’s version.`,cn:`实际情况与公关部那些人的说法有细微的差别。`},{en:`The show is refreshingly different from most exhibitions of modern art.`,cn:`这次展览与大多数现代艺术展不一样，令人耳目一新。`},{en:`The publishing business is no different from any other business in this respect.`,cn:`从这一点来讲，出版业和其他任何行业没有什么差别。`},{en:`It’s a different world here in London.`,cn:`伦敦这儿的情况完全不同。`}]},{word:`cake`,translation:`n. 蛋糕`,phonetic:`kek`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We had cake and ice cream.`,cn:`我们吃了蛋糕和冰激凌。`},{en:`a chocolate cake`,cn:`巧克力蛋糕`}]},{word:`candle`,translation:`n. 蜡烛`,phonetic:`'kændl`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The candle flickered in the wind.`,cn:`烛光在风中闪烁不定。`},{en:`The candle flickered and then went out.`,cn:`一开始蜡烛摇曳不定， 然后就灭了。`},{en:`The candle guttered out when the melted wax ran down its sides.`,cn:`熔化的蜡沿着蜡烛四周淌下，蜡烛就渐渐熄灭了。`}]},{word:`age`,translation:`n. 年龄`,phonetic:`edʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Francis is the same age as me.`,cn:`弗朗西斯和我同年岁。`},{en:`Experts disagree over the age of the drawings.`,cn:`专家对这些画作的年代意见不统一。`},{en:`Dad retired at the age of 56.`,cn:`爸爸是在56岁时退休的。`}]},{word:`make a wish`,translation:`许愿`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`If you see a falling star, don't wonder why, just make a wish.`,cn:`如果您看到一颗流星，不要怀疑，只要许一个愿。`},{en:`"Please make a wish when you fill in a single circular eye," Fukuda explained to Bush, according to the Japanese official.`,cn:`据这位日本官员介绍，福田首相向布什总统解释说，“画上一只眼睛后，请许下生日愿望。”`},{en:`It is now my birthday. In the US, we have a tradition that when you blow out the candles on your birthday cake, you should make a wish.`,cn:`今天是我的生日.在美国,有这样一个传统:当你吹灭生日蛋糕上的蜡烛的时候,就可以许一个愿望.`}]},{word:`blow`,translation:`v. 吹`,phonetic:`blo`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`.A cold breeze was blowing hard .`,cn:`寒风劲吹。`},{en:`It was blowing from an easterly direction.`,cn:`这是从东面吹过来的。`},{en:`Outside, the weather was blowing a gale .`,cn:`外面狂风大作。`}]},{word:`blow out`,translation:`吹灭`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I blew out the candle.`,cn:`我吹灭了蜡烛。`}]},{word:`if`,translation:`conj. 如果`,phonetic:`ɪf`,partOfSpeech:`conj`,examples:[{en:`We’ll stay at home if it rains.`,cn:`如果下雨，我们就待在家里。`},{en:`If you need money, I can lend you some.`,cn:`如果你需要钱，我能借给你一些。`},{en:`If I didn’t apologize, I’d feel guilty.`,cn:`如果我不道歉，我会感到内疚。`},{en:`If you had worked harder, you would have passed your exams.`,cn:`要是你再努力一点，就通过考试了。`},{en:`What would happen to your family if you were to die in an accident?`,cn:`要是你在意外事故中身亡，你的家人会怎么样呢？`},{en:`If Dad were here, he would know what to do.`,cn:`如果爸爸在这儿，他会知道怎么做的。`},{en:`Taste the soup and add salt and pepper if necessary.`,cn:`尝一下汤，需要的话加一点盐和胡椒粉。`},{en:`I want to get back by five o’clock if possible.`,cn:`如果可能的话，我想5点之前回来。`},{en:`I think I can fix it tomorrow. If not, you’ll have to wait till Friday.`,cn:`我想明天我能修好它，如果不行，你只好等到周五了。`},{en:`Is the book available, and if so, where?`,cn:`有没有这本书？ 如果有的话，在哪儿？`},{en:`The missiles can be fired only if the operator types in a six-digit code.`,cn:`只有在操作员输入一组六位数密码后，导弹才能发射。`},{en:`We’ll face that problem if and when it comes along (= if it happens or when it happens ).`,cn:`如果这一问题真的发生了，我们就要面对它。`},{en:`If by any chance you can’t manage dinner tonight, perhaps we can at least have a drink together.`,cn:`万一你今晚不能来吃饭，或许我们至少可以一起喝一杯。`}]},{word:`will`,translation:`v. 将，会，要（用于构成将来时）`,phonetic:`wɪl`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`A meeting will be held next Tuesday at 3 p.m.`,cn:`下星期二下午3点将召开一个会议。`},{en:`What time will she arrive?`,cn:`她什么时候到达？`},{en:`I hope they won’t be late.`,cn:`我希望他们不会迟到。`},{en:`Maybe by then you will have changed your mind.`,cn:`也许到那时你已经改变主意了。`}]},{word:`the UK`,translation:`n. 英国`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`It is not known if they will return to the UK for the child's birth .`,cn:`现在还不知道他们是否会为了孩子的出生而回到英国。`}]},{word:`candy`,translation:`n. 糖果`,phonetic:`ˈkændɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a box of candies`,cn:`一盒糖果`},{en:`a candy bar`,cn:`巧克力条`},{en:`Do you want a piece of candy?`,cn:`你要吃颗糖吗？`}]},{word:`lucky`,translation:`adj. 幸运的`,phonetic:`'lʌki`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I didn’t really know your name – it was just a lucky guess .`,cn:`我并不知道你的名字―只是运气好猜中的。`}]},{word:`popular`,translation:`adj. 受欢迎的；普遍的`,phonetic:`'pɑpjəlɚ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`Hilary was popular at school.`,cn:`希拉里在学校里很受欢迎。`},{en:`a popular holiday resort`,cn:`人们喜欢的度假胜地`},{en:`Coffee is probably the most popular drink in the world.`,cn:`咖啡很可能是世界上最受欢迎的饮料。`},{en:`the closest popular vote in U.S. presidential history`,cn:`美国总统选举史上票数最接近的一次普选`}]},{word:`get popular`,translation:`受欢迎；流行`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`cut up`,translation:`切碎`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Halve the tomatoes, then cut them up coarsely.`,cn:`把西红柿切成两半，然后再把它们粗略切一下。`}]},{word:`idea`,translation:`n. 想法；主意`,phonetic:`aɪ'diə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`You should talk to Ken – he's always full of good ideas.`,cn:`你应该和肯谈谈，他总是满脑子好主意。`},{en:`I knew it was a bad idea to leave him on his own.`,cn:`我知道把他独自留下不是个好主意。`},{en:`It was my wife’s idea to move house.`,cn:`要搬家是我妻子的主意。`}]},{word:`bring good luck to…`,translation:`给……带来好运`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`milk`,translation:`v. 挤奶`,phonetic:`mɪlk`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`I helped to milk the cows.`,cn:`我帮忙挤牛奶。`}]},{word:`cow`,translation:`n. 奶牛`,phonetic:`kaʊ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a herd of cows`,cn:`一群牛`}]},{word:`milk a cow`,translation:`给奶牛挤奶`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`After unveiling a cornerstone of a cooperation center for modern dairy technology in the farm, Olmert tried to milk a cow with milking machines.`,cn:`在参加了农场现代化奶制品技术合作中心的奠基仪式之后，奥尔默特尝试了用挤奶器挤牛奶。`}]},{word:`horse`,translation:`n. 马`,phonetic:`hɔrs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a horse and cart`,cn:`一辆马车`},{en:`Lee had never ridden a horse before.`,cn:`李以前从未骑过马。`}]},{word:`ride a horse`,translation:`骑马`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`I didn't know my times tables but I could milk a goat and ride a horse.`,cn:`我不知道乘法口诀表，但我知道如何给山羊挤奶和骑马。`},{en:`Adventure advice: You can also ride a horse. Mongolia has the most horses per person in the world.`,cn:`探险建议：你也可以骑马。蒙古是世界上每人拥有马匹数目最多的地方。`},{en:`Whether you’re interested in Western- or English-style horseback riding, some simple information can help you learn to ride a horse fast.`,cn:`无论你是对美国西部的还是英式的骑马方式感兴趣，以下简单的提示可以让你快速的学会骑马。`}]},{word:`feed`,translation:`v. 喂养；饲养`,phonetic:`fid`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Have you fed the cat?`,cn:`你喂猫了吗？`}]},{word:`feed chickens`,translation:`喂鸡`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Do you have to feed plants like you feed chickens?`,cn:`你必须像喂小鸡那样养育植物吗?。`},{en:`The fun never stops as you grow grass, feed chickens, collect eggs and take your produce to market.`,cn:`这项活动从未停止，你种草，饲料鸡，收集鸡蛋，把你的产品推向市场。`},{en:`Do you have to feed the plants as we feed chickens ?`,cn:`你是像喂鸡那样给植物施肥吗？`}]},{word:`farmer`,translation:`n. 农民；农场主`,phonetic:`'fɑmɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`},{word:`quite`,translation:`adv. 相当；颇`,phonetic:`kwaɪt`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`I felt quite bitter about it at the time.`,cn:`当时我对此感到相当痛苦。`},{en:`Well, actually it requires quite a bit of work and research.`,cn:`呃，实际上这需要相当多的工作和研究。`}]},{word:`quite a lot(of…)`,translation:`许多`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`anything`,translation:`pron. （常用于否定句或疑问句）任何东西；任何事物`,phonetic:`'ɛnɪ'θɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`You can buy anything you want.`,cn:`你想要什么都可以买。`},{en:`He was prepared to do anything to make a bit of money.`,cn:`只要能赚一点钱，他什么都愿意做。`},{en:`Anything would be better than staying at home!`,cn:`做什么都比待在家里好！`},{en:`You can write about swimming, skiing, or anything else you enjoy doing.`,cn:`你可以写游泳、写滑雪或者其他任何你喜欢的活动。`}]},{word:`grow`,translation:`v. 生长；种植`,phonetic:`ɡro`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`a tree which will grow well in most types of soil`,cn:`在大部分土壤里都能生长得很好的一种树`},{en:`The plants grow wild (= grow without anyone looking after them ) by the river.`,cn:`这些植物在河边自然生长。`},{en:`Many families own plots of land to grow food.`,cn:`许多人家都有自己的小块土地种植粮食。`}]},{word:`farm`,translation:`v. 务农；种田`,phonetic:`fɑrm`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`a 300-hectare farm`,cn:`一座300公顷的农场`},{en:`farm workers`,cn:`农场工人`},{en:`farm animals`,cn:`农场牲畜`},{en:`Joe had worked on the farm all his life.`,cn:`乔在农场干了一辈子。`},{en:`The family has farmed here for generations.`,cn:`这家人世代在此务农。`}]},{word:`pick`,translation:`v. 采；摘`,phonetic:`pɪk`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`We picked some blackberries to eat on the way.`,cn:`途中我们采了一些黑莓吃。`},{en:`Amy picked a small bunch of wild flowers.`,cn:`埃米采了一小把野花。`},{en:`a dish of freshly picked peas`,cn:`一盘新摘的豌豆`}]},{word:`excellent`,translation:`adj. 极好的；优秀的`,phonetic:`'ɛksələnt`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`an excellent suggestion`,cn:`极好的建议`},{en:`His car is in excellent condition.`,cn:`他的汽车状况极佳。`},{en:`Second-hand computers can be excellent value.`,cn:`二手计算机买得好会非常合算。`}]},{word:`countryside`,translation:`n. 乡村；农村`,phonetic:`'kʌntrɪsaɪd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The house had lovely views over open countryside .`,cn:`这房子望出去是开阔的乡村美景。`}]},{word:`in the countryside`,translation:`在乡下；在农村`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`It (so) chanced that I was in the countryside at the time.`,cn:`那时我恰巧在乡下。`}]},{word:`yesterday`,translation:`n. 昨天`,phonetic:`ˈjɛstɚdɪ;-de`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`yesterday’s meeting`,cn:`昨天的会议`},{en:`They arrived the day before yesterday.`,cn:`他们前天到的。`}]},{word:`flower`,translation:`n. 花`,phonetic:`'flaʊɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a lovely rose bush with delicate pink flowers`,cn:`一簇开着娇嫩的粉红色花朵的美丽蔷薇`},{en:`fields full of beautiful wild flowers`,cn:`开满美丽野花的田野`}]},{word:`worry`,translation:`v. 担心；担忧`,phonetic:`ˈwʌrɪ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`You’ve really got no need to worry about your weight.`,cn:`你真的不必担心你的体重。`},{en:`Don’t tell Mum about this – she’s got enough to worry about (= she already has a lot of problems or is very busy ) .`,cn:`别把这件事告诉妈妈——她已经够操心的了。`}]},{word:`luckily`,translation:`adv. 幸运地；好运地`,phonetic:`'lʌkɪli`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Luckily the museum was not damaged by the earthquake.`,cn:`幸好，博物馆没有在地震中遭到破坏。`}]},{word:`sun`,translation:`n. 太阳`,phonetic:`sʌn`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The sky was blue and the sun was shining.`,cn:`天空蔚蓝，阳光明媚。`}]},{word:`museum`,translation:`n. 博物馆`,phonetic:`mjuˈzɪəm`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the Museum of Modern Art`,cn:`现代艺术博物馆`},{en:`The museum has an extensive collection of early photographs.`,cn:`这座博物馆藏有大量早期的照片。`}]},{word:`fire`,translation:`n. 火；火灾`,phonetic:`'faɪr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The warehouse was completely destroyed by fire.`,cn:`仓库全给烧毁了。`},{en:`Thirty people died in a fire in downtown Chicago.`,cn:`30人死于芝加哥市中心的一场火灾。`},{en:`Police think that the fire was started deliberately.`,cn:`警方认为有人故意纵火。`},{en:`Rioters set fire to a whole row of stores (= made them start burning ) .`,cn:`暴徒纵火焚烧了一整排商店。`}]},{word:`fire station`,translation:`n. 消防站`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The bulb, which hangs idly about in a fire station in Livermore, California, holds the Guinness World Record.`,cn:`这只悠闲的挂在加州利物浦的一个消防站的灯泡，拥有了一项吉尼斯世界纪录。`},{en:`This study correlates the amount of fire damage in major residential fires to their distance from the nearest fire station.`,cn:`这个研究将主要住宅区火灾损失的金额与它们到最近消防站的距离关联起来。`}]},{word:`painting`,translation:`n. 油画；绘画`,phonetic:`'pentɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a collection of valuable paintings`,cn:`一批珍贵的画作`},{en:`Can you help me hang this painting (= put it on a wall ) ?`,cn:`你帮我把这幅画挂起来好吗？`}]},{word:`exciting`,translation:`adj. 使人兴奋的；令人激动的`,phonetic:`ɪk'saɪtɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`an exciting discovery`,cn:`激动人心的发现`},{en:`‘Julia and Paul are getting married!’ ‘Oh, how exciting!’`,cn:`“朱莉娅和保罗要结婚了！”“啊，太让人兴奋了！”`},{en:`I’ve got some very exciting news for you.`,cn:`我给你带来了一些很激动人心的消息。`},{en:`Let’s do something exciting.`,cn:`我们来做些让人振奋的事情吧。`},{en:`Melanie finds her work exciting and rewarding.`,cn:`梅拉妮觉得自己的工作既刺激又有意义。`}]},{word:`lovely`,translation:`adj. 可爱的`,phonetic:`'lʌvli`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`She had a lovely face.`,cn:`她有一张漂亮的脸蛋。`},{en:`What a lovely house!`,cn:`多么漂亮的房子啊！`},{en:`You look lovely in that dress.`,cn:`你穿那条连衣裙很漂亮。`},{en:`He was a lovely little boy.`,cn:`他是个可爱的小男孩。`},{en:`What a lovely day!`,cn:`多好的天气啊！`}]},{word:`expensive`,translation:`adj. 昂贵的`,phonetic:`ɪk'spɛnsɪv`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`the most expensive restaurant in town`,cn:`城里最贵的餐馆`},{en:`Petrol is becoming more and more expensive.`,cn:`汽油越来越贵了。`},{en:`Photography is an expensive hobby.`,cn:`摄影是一项很花钱的业余爱好。`},{en:`For low-income families, children’s safety equipment can be prohibitively expensive (= so expensive that most people cannot afford it ).`,cn:`对于低收入家庭来说，儿童的安全设备贵得让人望而却步。`},{en:`Employing the wrong builder can be a horribly expensive mistake.`,cn:`用错建筑工人有时会是代价高昂的错误。`},{en:`Her husband had expensive tastes (= liked expensive things ).`,cn:`她丈夫喜欢的东西都很贵。`}]},{word:`cheap`,translation:`adj. 廉价的；便宜的`,phonetic:`tʃip`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`cheap rail fares`,cn:`便宜的火车票`},{en:`the cheapest TV on the market`,cn:`市场上最便宜的电视机`},{en:`Property is cheaper in Spain than here.`,cn:`西班牙的房地产比这里便宜。`},{en:`a cheap shop (= one that sells goods cheaply )`,cn:`廉价商店`},{en:`The equipment is relatively cheap and simple to use.`,cn:`这种设备相对比较便宜，而且操作简单。`},{en:`This coat was dirt cheap (= very cheap – an informal expression 非正式用语 ) .`,cn:`这件外套超便宜。`}]},{word:`slow`,translation:`adj. 缓慢的；迟缓的`,phonetic:`sloʊ`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The car was travelling at a very slow speed.`,cn:`汽车正以非常慢的速度行驶。`},{en:`a slow walker`,cn:`慢慢走着的人`},{en:`The economy faces a year of slower growth.`,cn:`经济将面临增长更缓慢的一年。`},{en:`Take a few deep, slow breaths.`,cn:`慢慢地深吸几口气。`}]},{word:`fast`,translation:`adv. 快地; 释义：adj. 快的`,phonetic:`fæst`,partOfSpeech:`adv / 释义：adj`,examples:[{en:`Slow down – you’re driving too fast.`,cn:`慢点——你开得太快了。`},{en:`a fast-moving river`,cn:`湍急的河流`},{en:`Johnny ran off as fast as his legs could carry him (= running as quickly as he could ) .`,cn:`约翰尼飞也似的跑开了。`},{en:`a fast car`,cn:`速度很快的汽车`}]},{word:`robot`,translation:`n. 机器人`,phonetic:`'robɑt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`cars built by robots`,cn:`机器人制造的汽车`}]},{word:`guide`,translation:`n. 导游；向导`,phonetic:`ɡaɪd`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a tour guide`,cn:`导游`},{en:`an experienced mountain guide`,cn:`一位有经验的登山向导`}]},{word:`gift`,translation:`n. 礼物；赠品`,phonetic:`ɡɪft`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The earrings were a gift from my aunt.`,cn:`这副耳环是我姑姑送给我的礼物。`},{en:`The clock was given as a retirement gift when he left the police.`,cn:`这个钟表是他退休离开警局时收到的礼物。`},{en:`expensive wedding gifts`,cn:`昂贵的结婚礼物`},{en:`Enjoy a free gift with any purchase of $20 or more.`,cn:`购物满20美元奉送礼品一份。`},{en:`This excellent cookbook would make an ideal gift for anyone just going away to college.`,cn:`这本精美的烹饪书送给要离家上大学的人是很好的礼物。`}]},{word:`all in all`,translation:`总的说来`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`everything`,translation:`pron. 一切；所有事物`,phonetic:`'ɛvrɪ'θɪŋ`,partOfSpeech:`pron`,examples:[{en:`Everything was covered in a thick layer of dust.`,cn:`所有东西上面都蒙着厚厚一层灰。`},{en:`I decided to tell her everything.`,cn:`我决定把一切都告诉她。`},{en:`Apart from the bus arriving late, everything else seemed to be going according to plan.`,cn:`除了公共汽车晚点之外，其他一切似乎都在按计划进行。`}]},{word:`interested`,translation:`adj. 感兴趣的`,phonetic:`'ɪntrəstɪd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`I wasn’t sure if he was really interested or if he was just being polite.`,cn:`我不敢肯定他是真的感兴趣，还是出于礼貌而已。`}]},{word:`be interested in`,translation:`对……感兴趣`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`And why should anyone be interested in listening to our cough?`,cn:`凭什么会有人感兴趣来听我们的咳嗽呢？`},{en:`We would not be interested in human beings if we did not have the hope of someday meeting someone worse off than ourselves.`,cn:`如果我们没有在某天碰到某位比我们更糟糕的人，这种念头的话，我们还会对人类感兴趣吗？`},{en:`Many people in the organization or community would be interested in these documents, so you need a way to manage such users and their access.`,cn:`组织或社区中的很多人都可能对这些文档感兴趣，所以需要有一种方式来管理那些用户和他们的访问。`}]},{word:`dark`,translation:`adj. 黑暗的；昏暗的`,phonetic:`dɑrk`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`The church was dark and quiet.`,cn:`教堂里黑魆魆的，寂静无声。`},{en:`the dark winter days`,cn:`阴暗的冬日`},{en:`Suddenly, the room went dark (= became dark ) .`,cn:`房间突然变暗了。`},{en:`It gets dark (= night begins ) about ten o’clock.`,cn:`大约十点钟开始天黑。`},{en:`It was still dark (= was night ) when we boarded the train.`,cn:`我们上火车时天还是黑的。`},{en:`It was pitch dark (= completely dark ) in the attic.`,cn:`阁楼上漆黑一片。`}]},{word:`hear`,translation:`v. 听到；听见(过去式，过去分词 heard）`,phonetic:`hɪr`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Blanche heard a crash as the back door was flung open.`,cn:`布兰奇听见后门哗啦一声被推开。`},{en:`Did anyone see or hear anything last night?`,cn:`昨晚有没有人看见或听见什么？`},{en:`Old Zeke doesn’t hear too well any more.`,cn:`老齐克的耳朵已不灵了。`}]},{word:`camp`,translation:`v. 扎营;扎帐篷`,phonetic:`kæmp`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`We’ll camp by the river for the night, and move on tomorrow.`,cn:`我们今晚在河边露营，明天继续前进。`}]},{word:`lake`,translation:`n. 湖，湖泊`,phonetic:`lek`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Lake Michigan`,cn:`密歇根湖`}]},{word:`beach`,translation:`n. 海滩，沙滩`,phonetic:`bitʃ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a sandy beach`,cn:`沙滩`},{en:`surfers on the beach`,cn:`沙滩上的冲浪者`}]},{word:`badminton`,translation:`n. 羽毛球运动`,phonetic:`'bædmɪntən`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`I like playing basketball and  badminton.`,cn:`我喜欢的篮球和羽毛球。`},{en:`My friend and I take part in sports like tennis,badminton and swimming.`,cn:`我和我的朋友参加体育运动如打网球,羽毛球和游泳.`},{en:`When the shuttlecock was hit to and fro with a racket across a net, thegame was badminton.`,cn:`双方用球拍拍打毽子使它来来往往的越过网前，这种游戏就是羽毛球。`}]},{word:`sheep`,translation:`n. 羊，绵羊`,phonetic:`ʃip`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Sheep were grazing on the hillside.`,cn:`羊群在山坡上吃草。`},{en:`a sheep farmer`,cn:`养羊的农民`}]},{word:`as`,translation:`prep. 作为，当做`,phonetic:`æz; əz`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`As a parent, I feel that more should be done to protect our children.`,cn:`身为家长，我觉得应采取更多措施来保护我们的孩子。`}]},{word:`natural`,translation:`adj. 自然的`,phonetic:`'nætʃrəl`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`We should tap natural resources.`,cn:`我们应该开发自然资源。`},{en:`This feeling seems to be natural.`,cn:`这种感触似乎是自然的。`},{en:`They will only triumph by persevering in their struggle against natural calamities.`,cn:`他们只有坚持与自然灾害搏斗， 才能取得胜利。`}]},{word:`butterfly`,translation:`n. 蝴蝶`,phonetic:`'bʌtɚflaɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Butterflies and moths are attracted to the wild flowers.`,cn:`蝴蝶和飞蛾为野花所吸引。`}]},{word:`visitor`,translation:`n. 游客；访问者`,phonetic:`'vɪzɪtɚ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Times Square attracts more than 30 million visitors annually.`,cn:`时代广场每年吸引三千多万游客。`}]},{word:`tired`,translation:`adj. 疲倦的`,phonetic:`ˈtaɪrd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`He looks tired out (= very tired ) .`,cn:`他看起来累坏了。`},{en:`‘No,’ Frank said in a tired voice.`,cn:`“不。”弗兰克语带疲倦地说。`}]},{word:`stay`,translation:`v. 停留`,phonetic:`ste`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`They stayed all afternoon chatting.`,cn:`他们待了整个下午聊天。`},{en:`She stayed late to finish the report.`,cn:`为了完成报告，她工作到很晚。`}]},{word:`stay up late`,translation:`熬夜；睡得很晚`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Doctors suggest that people should not stay up late even on holidays.`,cn:`医生建议，即使在节假日人们也不应该熬夜。`},{en:`Researchers have verified the pattern that most parents have observed: sleep patterns change at puberty, and kids can’t seem to get out of bed in the morning. But they still stay up late at night.`,cn:`研究者们证实了大多数家长所观察到的情况：孩子的睡眠习惯在青春期时有所变化，尽管孩子们早上起不了床，他们在晚上依然精神抖擞地熬夜。`}]},{word:`away`,translation:`adv. 离开`,phonetic:`əˈwe`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`Go away!`,cn:`走开！`},{en:`Dinah was crying as she drove slowly away.`,cn:`黛娜一边哭一边慢慢地开车走了。`}]},{word:`run away`,translation:`跑开`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`They run away from the problem, hoping it will disappear of its own accord.`,cn:`他们回避了这个问题，希望它会自行消失。`}]},{word:`mouse`,translation:`n. 老鼠`,phonetic:`maʊs`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The cat laid a dead mouse at my feet.`,cn:`猫把一只死老鼠放在我的脚边。`},{en:`a field mouse`,cn:`田鼠`}]},{word:`baby`,translation:`n. 婴儿`,phonetic:`bebɪ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`The baby is crying.`,cn:`宝宝在哭。`},{en:`She gave birth to a baby on Thursday.`,cn:`她于星期四产下一名婴儿。`}]},{word:`shout`,translation:`v. 呼叫，喊叫`,phonetic:`ʃaʊt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`There’s no need to shout! I can hear you!`,cn:`用不着大声喊叫！我听得见！`},{en:`‘Watch out!’she shouted, as the car started to move.`,cn:`“小心！”汽车开动时，她大声喊道。`}]},{word:`shout at…`,translation:`冲……大声叫嚷`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`woof`,translation:`inter. （狗叫声）汪汪`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:`inter`},{word:`language`,translation:`n. 语言`,phonetic:`'læŋɡwɪdʒ`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`How many languages do you speak?`,cn:`你能说几种语言？`},{en:`one of the best-known poems in the English language`,cn:`最著名的英语诗歌之一`}]},{word:`fly`,translation:`v. 乘飞机旅行；飞，飞翔`,phonetic:`flaɪ`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`She’s flying back to the States tomorrow.`,cn:`她明天乘飞机回美国。`},{en:`Will you take the train there or fly?`,cn:`你去那里是坐火车还是坐飞机？`},{en:`Maurice is nervous about flying, so he usually travels overland.`,cn:`莫里斯害怕乘坐飞机，因此他一般走陆路。`},{en:`The mother bird will feed her chicks until they are able to fly.`,cn:`母鸟将喂养小鸟直到它们会飞。`}]},{word:`kite`,translation:`n. 风筝`,phonetic:`kaɪt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She has a blue and green kite.`,cn:`她有一只蓝色和绿色的风筝。`},{en:`The child tailed his kite.`,cn:`小孩儿给自己的风筝装了尾巴。`},{en:`He tried to fly his kite.`,cn:`他试图放飞他的风筝。`}]},{word:`fly a kite`,translation:`放风筝`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`Go for a walk, fly a kite and visit the zoo.`,cn:`散散步，放放风筝，逛逛动物园。`},{en:`Almost as if the inner child in us wants to put the rest of the world on hold and just run outside to climb a tree or fly a kite.`,cn:`仿佛我们内心的童真想要撂下整个世界，就只是跑出去爬爬树，或者放放风筝。`},{en:`India was named best place to fly a kite as the pastime is a daily activity for many Indians.`,cn:`在印度，放风筝是很多印度人日常生活消遣的活动，所以被评为最适合放风筝的国家。`}]},{word:`high`,translation:`adj. 高的; adv. （离地面）高高地；在[向]高处`,phonetic:`haɪ`,partOfSpeech:`adj / adv`,examples:[{en:`This is the highest mountain in Japan.`,cn:`这是日本最高的山。`},{en:`The camp was surrounded by a high fence.`,cn:`营地四周围着高高的栅栏。`},{en:`a ten-foot high statue`,cn:`10英尺高的雕像`},{en:`How high is the Eiffel Tower?`,cn:`埃菲尔铁塔有多高？`},{en:`He kicked the ball high into the air, over the heads of the crowd.`,cn:`他把球高高地踢向空中，越过了人群。`}]},{word:`high school`,translation:`中学`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`high school students`,cn:`高中生`},{en:`high school graduates`,cn:`高中毕业生`}]},{word:`ago`,translation:`adv. 以前`,phonetic:`ə'ɡo`,partOfSpeech:`adv`,examples:[{en:`They moved to a new house some time ago (=  a fairly long time ago  ) .`,cn:`他们搬进新居已有些日子了。`},{en:`We had our bicentenary celebrations not that long ago.`,cn:`不久前，我们举行了200周年庆典活动。`}]},{word:`India`,translation:`n. 印度`,phonetic:`'ɪndɪə`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`Burma borders on India.`,cn:`缅甸与印度毗邻。`},{en:`This book treats of the caste system in India.`,cn:`这本书论述了印度的种姓制度。`},{en:`If you come to India for just one thing, this should be it.`,cn:`如果你只为一件事来到印度，那就到这儿来吧。`}]},{word:`tent`,translation:`n. 帐篷`,phonetic:`tɛnt`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`We looked for a flat spot where we could pitch our tent (= put up our tent ) .`,cn:`我们寻找一个平缓的地方搭帐篷。`}]},{word:`put up`,translation:`搭起，举起`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`moon`,translation:`n. 月亮`,phonetic:`mun`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`the craters on the surface of the moon`,cn:`月球表面的环形山`},{en:`The Americans landed on the Moon in 1969.`,cn:`美国人于1969年登上月球。`},{en:`The moon appeared from behind a cloud.`,cn:`月亮从云后钻了出来。`},{en:`The moon rose into the sky.`,cn:`月亮升上天空。`},{en:`The moon was shining in the sky.`,cn:`月儿当空照。`}]},{word:`surprise`,translation:`n. 惊奇，惊讶; v. 使吃惊`,phonetic:`sɚ'praɪz`,partOfSpeech:`n / v`,examples:[{en:`The man had a look of surprise on his face.`,cn:`那人脸上一副惊讶的表情。`},{en:`We'll solve the case ourselves and surprise everyone.`,cn:`我们将自己解决这件事，并让所有人吃惊。`}]},{word:`get a surprise`,translation:`吃惊`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`If she comes, she will get a surprise.`,cn:`如果她来，她会大吃一惊。`}]},{word:`snake`,translation:`n. 蛇`,phonetic:`snek`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`A snake slithered across our path.`,cn:`一条蛇蜿蜒爬过我们的小路。`}]},{word:`scared`,translation:`adj. 惊慌的`,phonetic:`skɛrd`,partOfSpeech:`adj`,examples:[{en:`At first, he was really scared.`,cn:`刚开始时他非常害怕。`}]},{word:`move`,translation:`v. 移动`,phonetic:`muv`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`Please keep the doors closed while the train is moving.`,cn:`火车行驶时请保持车门关闭。`},{en:`‘Come on,’ Sue said. No one moved.`,cn:`“来吧。”休说。但没有人动。`},{en:`Could you move your car, please? It’s blocking the road.`,cn:`你能把车挪一下吗？挡着路了。`},{en:`Becca moved down the steps and into the yard.`,cn:`贝卡走下台阶，来到院子里。`},{en:`The bar was so crowded you could hardly move .`,cn:`酒吧很挤，人都难以挪动。`},{en:`At Christmas, you couldn’t move for toys in this house (= there were a lot of toys ) .`,cn:`圣诞节的时候，这房子里玩具多得让人都挪不开步。`},{en:`Paul couldn’t move a muscle (= could not move at all ) – he was so scared.`,cn:`保罗动弹不得——他吓坏了。`}]},{word:`shout to…`,translation:`对……大声喊叫`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``},{word:`start`,translation:`v. 开始，着手`,phonetic:`stɑrt`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`There’s so much to do. I don’t know where to start.`,cn:`有那么多的事情要做，我都不知道从哪里开始。`},{en:`Have you started your homework?`,cn:`你开始做家庭作业了吗？`},{en:`I’d better get started (= start doing something ) soon.`,cn:`我最好马上就开始。`}]},{word:`jump`,translation:`v. 跳跃`,phonetic:`dʒʌmp`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`The cats jumped down and came to meet us.`,cn:`这些猫跳下来，过来迎接我们。`}]},{word:`up and down`,translation:`上上下下`,phonetic:``,partOfSpeech:``,examples:[{en:`The escalator wafts us up and down every day.`,cn:`自动扶梯天天送我们上上下下。`},{en:`What you do is squat up and down really fast.`,cn:`你 所要做的就是真正快速地上下蹲坐。`}]},{word:`wake`,translation:`v. 弄醒，醒`,phonetic:`wek`,partOfSpeech:`v`,examples:[{en:`When she woke, the sun was streaming through the windows.`,cn:`她醒来时，阳光泻入窗内。`},{en:`Try not to wake the baby.`,cn:`尽量不要吵醒宝宝。`}]},{word:`into`,translation:`prep. 到……里面`,phonetic:`ˈɪntu`,partOfSpeech:`prep`,examples:[{en:`Come into the office.`,cn:`到办公室里来。`},{en:`He thrust his hand into his coat pocket.`,cn:`他把手插进大衣口袋里。`},{en:`There must be another way into the cave.`,cn:`一定有其他的路可以进入洞穴。`},{en:`Sue got back into bed and pulled the quilt over her head.`,cn:`休回到床上，拉过被子蒙住头。`},{en:`I’ve got to go into town this morning.`,cn:`我今天上午得进城去。`},{en:`We dived into the sea.`,cn:`我们跳进海里。`}]},{word:`forest`,translation:`n. 森林`,phonetic:`'fɔrɪst`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`a tropical forest`,cn:`热带森林`},{en:`the danger of forest fires`,cn:`发生森林火灾的危险`}]},{word:`ear`,translation:`n. 耳朵`,phonetic:`ɪr`,partOfSpeech:`n`,examples:[{en:`She tucked her hair behind her ears.`,cn:`她把头发拢到耳朵背后。`}]}];export{e as default};